#: data/text/tv.inc:1
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_InterviewRequest"
msgid ""
"Oh, hello! You were in a POKéMON\n"
"CONTEST, weren't you?\l"
"It's easy to tell from your POKéMON.\p"
"I'm a reporter. I'm working on a story\n"
"on POKéMON CONTESTS.\p"
"If I may, would you be willing to answer\n"
"a few questions?$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你好！你刚才参加了\n"
"宝可梦华丽大赛吧？\l"
"看你的宝可梦就知道了。\p"
"我是一名记者，正在写一篇\n"
"关于宝可梦华丽大赛的报道。\p"
"方便的话，能不能请你\n"
"回答几个问题呢？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:10
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_DescribeContest"
msgid ""
"Oh, you will?\n"
"Thank you.\p"
"Briefly, how would you describe the\n"
"CONTEST you just entered?$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你愿意吗？\n"
"谢谢你。\p"
"简单来说，你会怎么形容\n"
"你刚才参加的华丽大赛呢？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:16
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_WhatImageWhenYouHearX"
msgid ""
"Ah, I see.\n"
"That's a very edifying comment.\p"
"You get a good feel for what\n"
"the CONTEST was like.\p"
"I've got one last question.\p"
"When you hear the word “{STR_VAR_2},”\n"
"what image do you get?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，原来如此。\n"
"真是很有启发的评论。\p"
"听了你的话，我对那场\n"
"华丽大赛有了很清楚的印象。\p"
"最后一个问题。\p"
"听到“{STR_VAR_2}”这个词，\n"
"你会联想到什么呢？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:25
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ThatsAllForInterview"
msgid ""
"I see!\p"
"So that's how you imagine the concept\n"
"of “{STR_VAR_2}” to be.\p"
"Thank you!\n"
"You've given me some good ideas.\p"
"I think I can write a good story on\n"
"POKéMON CONTESTS now.\p"
"Maybe, just maybe, this story will even\n"
"make it to television.\l"
"I hope you'll look forward to it!$"
msgstr ""
"原来如此！\p"
"原来你心目中的\n"
"“{STR_VAR_2}”是这样的啊。\p"
"谢谢你！\n"
"你给了我很多好点子。\p"
"现在我应该能写出一篇\n"
"很棒的华丽大赛报道了。\p"
"说不定，这篇报道\n"
"还会上电视呢。\l"
"敬请期待吧！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:37
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_PleaseDoShareStoryWithMe"
msgid ""
"Oh, too bad…\p"
"Well, if you come across a good story,\n"
"please do share it with me.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，真遗憾……\p"
"如果你碰到什么好故事，\n"
"一定要告诉我哦。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:42
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_LookingForwardToNextContest"
msgid ""
"I'll be looking forward to your next\n"
"POKéMON CONTEST.$"
msgstr ""
"我很期待你在下一次\n"
"宝可梦华丽大赛中的表现。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:46
msgctxt "gTVBravoTrainerText00"
msgid ""
"Yeah!\n"
"It's BRAVO TRAINER time!\p"
"Today, we're going to profile a POKéMON\n"
"belonging to {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Now, this POKéMON boasts a {STR_VAR_3}\n"
"Rank in the {STR_VAR_2} Category.$"
msgstr ""
"耶！\n"
"“训练家大喝彩”时间到啦！\p"
"今天我们要介绍的是\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}的宝可梦。\p"
"这只宝可梦在{STR_VAR_2}类别中\n"
"拥有{STR_VAR_3}的实力！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:54
msgctxt "gTVBravoTrainerText01"
msgid ""
"Introducing {STR_VAR_2} the\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"The nickname {STR_VAR_2}…\p"
"Even the nickname exudes an air that\n"
"proclaims “{STR_VAR_3}”!$"
msgstr ""
"为大家介绍这只{STR_VAR_1}——\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}！\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}这个昵称……\p"
"光是昵称就散发着\n"
"“{STR_VAR_3}”的气息！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:61
msgctxt "gTVBravoTrainerText02"
msgid ""
"Anyway, when the TRAINER {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"entered the POKéMON in a CONTEST,\l"
"we managed to get a few impassioned\l"
"quotes about the trusty partner.$"
msgstr ""
"话说，训练家{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"带这只宝可梦参加华丽大赛时，\l"
"我们采访到了几句\l"
"对这位可靠搭档的热情发言。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:67
msgctxt "gTVBravoTrainerText03"
msgid ""
"Asked about the CONTEST afterwards,\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} happily replied with a huge\l"
"grin, “{STR_VAR_2}!”\p"
"Well, sure, {STR_VAR_1}'s POKéMON came in\n"
"number {STR_VAR_3} in the CONTEST.\p"
"That line perfectly suits {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"right now, I'd say!$"
msgstr ""
"赛后问起华丽大赛的感想，\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}满脸笑容，\l"
"开心地回答：“{STR_VAR_2}！”\p"
"没错，{STR_VAR_1}的宝可梦\n"
"在华丽大赛中得了第{STR_VAR_3}名。\p"
"我想，这句话正好道出了\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}现在的心情！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:76
msgctxt "gTVBravoTrainerText04"
msgid ""
"Asked about the CONTEST afterwards,\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} replied with a tinge of\l"
"bitterness, “{STR_VAR_2}.”\p"
"Well, sure, {STR_VAR_1}'s POKéMON came in\n"
"number {STR_VAR_3} in the CONTEST.\p"
"{STR_VAR_1}'s disappointment comes across\n"
"loud and clear, I'd say!$"
msgstr ""
"赛后问起华丽大赛的感想，\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}有些不甘地回答：\l"
"“{STR_VAR_2}。”\p"
"没错，{STR_VAR_1}的宝可梦\n"
"在华丽大赛中得了第{STR_VAR_3}名。\p"
"{STR_VAR_1}的失落之情\n"
"真是溢于言表啊！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:85
msgctxt "gTVBravoTrainerText05"
msgid ""
"Wouldn't you also like to know what\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} imagines {STR_VAR_2} to be?\p"
"You bet we did!\n"
"So we asked, of course!\p"
"The answer is all perfectly condensed:\n"
"“{STR_VAR_3}!”\p"
"That's what the concept of {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"represents to {STR_VAR_1}!$"
msgstr ""
"大家是不是也想知道\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}怎么看待{STR_VAR_2}？\p"
"我们当然也想知道！\n"
"所以就直接问了！\p"
"答案浓缩成了一句话：\n"
"“{STR_VAR_3}！”\p"
"这就是{STR_VAR_1}心目中\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}的意义！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:95
msgctxt "gTVBravoTrainerText06"
msgid ""
"The last move {STR_VAR_2} used by\n"
"the {STR_VAR_1} is entirely about\l"
"“{STR_VAR_3}”!$"
msgstr ""
"那只{STR_VAR_1}最后使出的\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}，完全就是\l"
"“{STR_VAR_3}”的写照！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:100
msgctxt "gTVBravoTrainerText07"
msgid ""
"Bravo, {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"Bravo, {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"I hope we can count on seeing\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} scale even greater heights!\p"
"That's all the time we have!\n"
"Until next time, see you!$"
msgstr ""
"太棒了，{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"太棒了，{STR_VAR_2}！\p"
"希望{STR_VAR_1}今后\n"
"能攀登更高的巅峰！\p"
"节目时间到了！\n"
"我们下次再见！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:108
msgctxt "gTVBravoTrainerText08"
msgid "Introducing the TRAINER's {STR_VAR_1}!$"
msgstr "为大家介绍训练家的{STR_VAR_1}！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:111
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_InterviewRequest"
msgid ""
"Hello! You're the TRAINER who just had\n"
"a battle, right?\p"
"I'm gathering interviews with TRAINERS\n"
"all over the place.\p"
"May I get a few words from you about\n"
"your impressions on battling?$"
msgstr ""
"你好！你就是刚刚\n"
"进行过对战的训练家吧？\p"
"我正在四处采访\n"
"各地的训练家。\p"
"能不能请你谈谈\n"
"对战的感想呢？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:119
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_HowDidBattleTowerTurnOut"
msgid ""
"You will? Really?\n"
"Thank you!\l"
"Then, uh…\p"
"How did things turn out in\n"
"the BATTLE TOWER today?\p"
"Were you satisfied with the battle?\n"
"Or are you unhappy?$"
msgstr ""
"你愿意吗？真的吗？\n"
"谢谢你！\l"
"那么，呃……\p"
"今天在对战塔的\n"
"战绩如何呢？\p"
"你对这次对战满意吗？\n"
"还是不太满意呢？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:128
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_SorryWeDisturbedYou"
msgid ""
"Oh…\n"
"Sorry we disturbed you.\p"
"Please give us an interview the next\n"
"time you visit the BATTLE TOWER.$"
msgstr ""
"哦……\n"
"打扰你了，不好意思。\p"
"下次来对战塔的时候，\n"
"请接受我们的采访吧。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:134
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ObviousYouHadGreatBattle"
msgid ""
"Well, of course!\p"
"That unmistakable look of satisfaction\n"
"on your face…\p"
"It's obvious that you've had a great\n"
"battle.$"
msgstr ""
"那是当然的！\p"
"你脸上那种\n"
"心满意足的表情……\p"
"一看就知道\n"
"你打了一场漂亮的对战。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:141
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_DifficultToMakeBattleTurnOutAsPlanned"
msgid ""
"Oh, I see…\p"
"Well, it certainly is difficult to make a\n"
"battle turn out exactly as planned.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，这样啊……\p"
"要让对战完全按计划进行，\n"
"确实是很难的。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:146
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_DescribeYourBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh, oh, may I ask one more question?\p"
"If you were to describe your\n"
"impressions about this battle with\l"
"one saying, what would it be?$"
msgstr ""
"哦哦，能再问一个问题吗？\p"
"如果要用一句话\n"
"形容这场对战的感想，\l"
"你会怎么说呢？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:152
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_ThatsGreatLine"
msgid ""
"Oh, that is stunningly cool!\p"
"That's a great line!\n"
"I hope you'll do great next time, too.\p"
"I hope to see you again!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，这真是太酷了！\p"
"说得太好了！\n"
"希望你下次也能大显身手。\p"
"期待与你再见！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:158
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_SilentType"
msgid ""
"Oh, I see…\p"
"Still, being the silent type is also\n"
"cool, isn't it?\p"
"I hope you'll give me the opportunity\n"
"to share your thoughts again!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，这样啊……\p"
"不过，沉默寡言\n"
"也挺酷的，对吧？\p"
"希望下次还有机会\n"
"听听你的想法！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:165
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_Text_LookingForwardToNextBattle"
msgid ""
"I'll be looking forward to your\n"
"next battle!$"
msgstr ""
"我很期待\n"
"你的下一场对战！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:169
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_Intro"
msgid ""
"Yeah!\n"
"It's BRAVO TRAINER time!\p"
"Today, we're going to profile {STR_VAR_1},\n"
"who took the BATTLE TOWER challenge!\p"
"For the challenge, {STR_VAR_1} entered\n"
"one wicked {STR_VAR_2}.$"
msgstr ""
"耶！\n"
"“训练家大喝彩”时间到啦！\p"
"今天要介绍的是挑战了\n"
"对战塔的{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"{STR_VAR_1}在这次挑战中\n"
"派出了一只超厉害的{STR_VAR_2}。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:177
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_NewRecord"
msgid ""
"The pair set a new record of {STR_VAR_2} wins\n"
"in a row in {STR_VAR_1} competition!\l"
"Bravo, TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""
"这对组合在{STR_VAR_1}的比赛中\n"
"创下了{STR_VAR_2}连胜的新纪录！\l"
"太棒了，训练家！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:182
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_Lost"
msgid ""
"The twosome finally succumbed to\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} in match number {STR_VAR_2}.\l"
"Nice try, TRAINER!\p"
"But, hey, it's just bad luck to run into\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} so early in the challenge.\p"
"We asked the TRAINER for impressions\n"
"on the match with {STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"在第{STR_VAR_2}场比赛中，这对组合\n"
"终于败给了{STR_VAR_1}。\l"
"虽败犹荣，训练家！\p"
"不过，挑战才刚开始\n"
"就碰上{STR_VAR_1}，真是运气不好。\p"
"我们请训练家谈了谈\n"
"与{STR_VAR_1}对战的感想。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:191
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_Won"
msgid ""
"The twosome won it all by defeating\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}'s {STR_VAR_2} thoroughly.\l"
"Bravo, TRAINER!\p"
"Knocking off even {STR_VAR_1}…\n"
"It defies belief! Simply astounding!\p"
"We asked the TRAINER for impressions\n"
"on the moment of glory.$"
msgstr ""
"这对组合彻底击败了\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}，赢得了全胜！\l"
"太棒了，训练家！\p"
"连{STR_VAR_1}都被打倒了……\n"
"真是难以置信！太惊人了！\p"
"我们请训练家谈了谈\n"
"荣耀时刻的感想。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:200
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_LostFinal"
msgid ""
"After a string of wins, the pair finally\n"
"succumbed to {STR_VAR_1}'s {STR_VAR_2},\l"
"their final hurdle.\p"
"Nice try, TRAINER!\p"
"Still, you have to give credit.\n"
"You don't see many famous combinations\l"
"like {STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"We asked the TRAINER for impressions\n"
"on battling the celebrity pair.$"
msgstr ""
"连胜之后，这对组合终于\n"
"败给了最后的难关——\l"
"{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_2}。\p"
"虽败犹荣，训练家！\p"
"不过，这也怪不得训练家。\n"
"像{STR_VAR_1}和{STR_VAR_2}这样\l"
"有名的组合可不多见。\p"
"我们请训练家谈了谈\n"
"与这对明星组合对战的感想。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:211
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_Satisfied"
msgid ""
"This is what the TRAINER had to say:\n"
"“I'm satisfied!”\p"
"Now isn't that a refreshing reply?\n"
"Bravo, TRAINER!\p"
"Isn't it out-and-out awesome to be\n"
"able to battle to full satisfaction?\p"
"I found out exactly how satisfied\n"
"when I heard the TRAINER say this:$"
msgstr ""
"训练家是这么说的：\n"
"“我很满意！”\p"
"这回答是不是很爽快？\n"
"太棒了，训练家！\p"
"能打得尽兴满意，\n"
"是不是超级痛快？\p"
"听到训练家的这句话，\n"
"我就知道有多满意了：$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:221
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_Unsatisfied"
msgid ""
"This is what the TRAINER had to say:\n"
"“I'm not satisfied…”\p"
"Our TRAINER was obviously a little down\n"
"when that was uttered.\p"
"Still, it's not easy to be able to battle\n"
"with complete satisfaction, am I right?\p"
"Anyway, I found out how dissatisfied\n"
"our TRAINER was when I heard this:$"
msgstr ""
"训练家是这么说的：\n"
"“我不太满意……”\p"
"说这句话的时候，\n"
"我们的训练家显然有点沮丧。\p"
"不过，要打出完全满意的对战\n"
"可不容易，对吧？\p"
"总之，听到训练家的这句话，\n"
"我就知道有多不满了：$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:231
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_None1"
msgid "None$"
msgstr "无$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:234
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_None2"
msgid "None$"
msgstr "无$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:237
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_None3"
msgid "None$"
msgstr "无$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:240
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_None4"
msgid "None$"
msgstr "无$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:243
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_Response"
msgid "“{STR_VAR_1}.”$"
msgstr "“{STR_VAR_1}。”$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:246
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_ResponseSatisfied"
msgid ""
"“{STR_VAR_1}.”\n"
"Now isn't that great?\p"
"It really expresses {STR_VAR_2}'s joy,\n"
"I'd say.\p"
"That battle with {STR_VAR_3} at the\n"
"end… It really was what you'd call\l"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”!$"
msgstr ""
"“{STR_VAR_1}。”\n"
"是不是很棒？\p"
"这句话真是充分表达了\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}的喜悦。\p"
"最后和{STR_VAR_3}的那场对战……\n"
"真可以说是\l"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”啊！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:255
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_ResponseUnsatisfied"
msgid ""
"“{STR_VAR_1}.”\n"
"Now isn't that fitting?\p"
"That battle with {STR_VAR_3} at the\n"
"end… You can't describe it as anything\l"
"else but “{STR_VAR_1}”!\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}'s disappointment comes across\n"
"loud and clear, I'd say!$"
msgstr ""
"“{STR_VAR_1}。”\n"
"是不是很贴切？\p"
"最后和{STR_VAR_3}的那场对战……\n"
"除了“{STR_VAR_1}”之外，\l"
"再也找不到别的形容了！\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}的失落之情\n"
"真是溢于言表啊！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:264
msgctxt "BravoTrainerBattleTower_Text_Outro"
msgid ""
"Bravo, {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"Bravo, {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"I hope we can count on seeing\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} scale even greater heights!\p"
"That's all the time we have!\n"
"Until next time, see you!$"
msgstr ""
"太棒了，{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"太棒了，{STR_VAR_2}！\p"
"希望{STR_VAR_1}今后\n"
"能攀登更高的巅峰！\p"
"节目时间到了！\n"
"我们下次再见！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:272
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_InterviewRequestHasName"
msgid ""
"Wow!\p"
"It's plain to see that you lavish your\n"
"love on your {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Okay, it's named {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"Can I ask you a favor?\p"
"I'm a TV reporter, and I'm running\n"
"a survey on POKéMON.\p"
"Would you be willing to answer a few\n"
"simple questions for me?$"
msgstr ""
"哇！\p"
"一看就知道你非常疼爱\n"
"你的{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"嗯，它的名字叫{STR_VAR_2}啊。\p"
"能请你帮个忙吗？\p"
"我是电视台的记者，\n"
"正在做一项宝可梦的调查。\p"
"你愿意回答我几个\n"
"简单的问题吗？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:283
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_HereGoesQuickAnswers"
msgid ""
"Great! Thank you!\p"
"Okay, here goes.\n"
"I just need quick answers, okay?$"
msgstr ""
"太好了！谢谢你！\p"
"好，那我开始问了。\n"
"简单回答就可以了哦。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:288
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_DescribeFeelingsFirstMetMon"
msgid ""
"When you first met {STR_VAR_1},\n"
"what did you feel?\p"
"How would you describe your feelings\n"
"at the time?$"
msgstr ""
"你第一次遇见{STR_VAR_1}的时候，\n"
"是什么感觉？\p"
"你会怎么形容\n"
"当时的心情呢？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:294
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_LikenMonToSomethingYouLike"
msgid ""
"Your {STR_VAR_1} is cared for lovingly.\p"
"If you were to liken it to something\n"
"that you like, what would it be?$"
msgstr ""
"你的{STR_VAR_1}被照顾得很好呢。\p"
"如果把它比作你喜欢的\n"
"东西，那会是什么呢？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:299
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_WhatAttractedYouAboutMon"
msgid ""
"This question also relates to your\n"
"beloved {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"What was it about {STR_VAR_1} that\n"
"attracted you?$"
msgstr ""
"这个问题也和你心爱的\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}有关。\p"
"{STR_VAR_1}的什么地方\n"
"吸引了你呢？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:305
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_WhatDoPokemonMeanToYou"
msgid ""
"Okay, that makes sense.\p"
"The next question might be a little\n"
"on the tough side.\p"
"Here goes…\p"
"What do POKéMON mean to you?$"
msgstr ""
"嗯，有道理。\p"
"下一个问题\n"
"可能有点难哦。\p"
"我要问了……\p"
"宝可梦对你来说意味着什么？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:312
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ThatsAllForInterview"
msgid ""
"I see!\p"
"Hmhm…\p"
"Okay!\n"
"Thanks for helping me out.\p"
"It was fun and enlightening\n"
"chatting with you.\p"
"It's possible that our interview will\n"
"end up on TV. Tune in and check!\p"
"Okay, that's all.\n"
"Bye-bye!$"
msgstr ""
"原来如此！\p"
"嗯嗯……\p"
"好了！\n"
"谢谢你的帮忙。\p"
"和你聊天\n"
"既开心又长见识。\p"
"我们的采访可能会上电视，\n"
"记得收看哦！\p"
"好，就这些了。\n"
"拜拜！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:324
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_HereIfYouGetUrgeToTellMe"
msgid ""
"Oh, okay…\p"
"Well, if you get the urge to tell me\n"
"about POKéMON, I'll be here!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，这样啊……\p"
"如果你想跟我聊聊宝可梦，\n"
"随时来找我哦！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:329
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_EnjoyDoingInterviews"
msgid ""
"I enjoy this job--you get to learn\n"
"about POKéMON by doing interviews.$"
msgstr ""
"我很喜欢这份工作——\n"
"通过采访能了解很多宝可梦的事。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:333
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_InterviewRequest"
msgid ""
"Hi, you seem to be very close to your\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Do you know what?\n"
"I'm a TV reporter.\p"
"I travel around interviewing people\n"
"about POKéMON.\p"
"I'm wondering if you'd be willing to tell\n"
"me a little about your {STR_VAR_1}?$"
msgstr ""
"你好，你和你的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"好像感情很好呢。\p"
"告诉你哦，\n"
"我是电视台的记者。\p"
"我到处采访大家\n"
"关于宝可梦的事。\p"
"你愿意跟我聊聊\n"
"你的{STR_VAR_1}吗？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:343
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_TellMeAnythingAboutYourMon"
msgid ""
"Wow, thank you!\p"
"Okay, then, please tell me anything\n"
"you'd like about your {STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"哇，谢谢你！\p"
"那么，关于你的{STR_VAR_1}，\n"
"想说什么都可以哦。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:348
msgctxt "SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ThatsAllForInterview2"
msgid ""
"Wow…\n"
"That's an interesting account.\p"
"You really are tight with {STR_VAR_1},\n"
"aren't you?\p"
"I get the feeling that your account\n"
"will make a great TV story.\p"
"I promise that I'll turn this into\n"
"an entertaining show.\l"
"Keep your eyes out for it.\p"
"Okay, that's all.\n"
"Bye-bye!$"
msgstr ""
"哇……\n"
"真是有趣的故事。\p"
"你和{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"真的很亲密呢。\p"
"我觉得你的故事\n"
"能做成很棒的电视节目。\p"
"我保证会把它做成\n"
"一档有趣的节目。\l"
"记得留意收看哦。\p"
"好，就这些了。\n"
"拜拜！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:361
msgctxt "gTVFanClubOpinionsText00"
msgid ""
"WE ARE THE POKéMON FAN CLUB!\p"
"We're on the air!\p"
"On this program, we get your opinions,\n"
"and I shout them out on your behalf!\l"
"Isn't it a fantastic program concept?\p"
"Today, we bring you this report from\n"
"our reporter, who we sent out to the\l"
"POKéMON FAN CLUB.\p"
"So, just who is today's featured\n"
"POKéMON fan?\p"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"So, let's hear what {STR_VAR_1} has to\n"
"say about {STR_VAR_3} the {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"And, I will shout those words of love\n"
"out loud on TV!\p"
"Hoo-hah!\p"
"Let's shout!$"
msgstr ""
"我们是宝可梦爱好者俱乐部！\p"
"节目开始啦！\p"
"在这个节目里，我们收集\n"
"大家的心声，再由我替大家\l"
"大声喊出来！\l"
"是不是很棒的节目创意？\p"
"今天要为大家带来的，是\n"
"派驻宝可梦爱好者俱乐部的\l"
"记者送回来的报道！\p"
"那么，今天登场的\n"
"宝可梦爱好者是谁呢？\p"
"…… …… …… ……\p"
"{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"那就来听听{STR_VAR_1}对{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"“{STR_VAR_3}”有什么话要说吧。\p"
"然后，我会把这些充满爱的话\n"
"在电视上大声喊出来！\p"
"嚯哈！\p"
"一起来喊吧！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:381
msgctxt "gTVFanClubOpinionsText01"
msgid ""
"We asked {STR_VAR_1}, “When you first\n"
"laid eyes on your {STR_VAR_2}, what was\l"
"your initial thought?”\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3}!”\p"
"Yeahah! That's a mighty fine shout!\p"
"Doesn't it bring back memories of those\n"
"days long gone by?$"
msgstr ""
"我们问了{STR_VAR_1}：“第一次见到\n"
"你的{STR_VAR_2}时，你是怎么想的？”\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3}！”\p"
"耶哈！喊得真漂亮！\p"
"是不是让人想起了\n"
"那些逝去的美好时光？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:390
msgctxt "gTVFanClubOpinionsText02"
msgid ""
"We asked {STR_VAR_1}, “If you were to\n"
"liken your {STR_VAR_2} to something,\l"
"it would be…”\p"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3}!”\p"
"Whoah-oh, now that's an original idea!\p"
"You sure can sense the intensity of\n"
"feeling the TRAINER has for\l"
"{STR_VAR_2}.$"
msgstr ""
"我们问了{STR_VAR_1}：“如果要把\n"
"你的{STR_VAR_2}比作某样东西，\l"
"那会是……”\p"
"…… …… …… ……\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3}！”\p"
"哇哦，真是独特的想法！\p"
"能感受到训练家对{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"那份强烈的感情。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:401
msgctxt "gTVFanClubOpinionsText03"
msgid ""
"And let's see…\n"
"What was it about that {STR_VAR_2}\l"
"that so attracted {STR_VAR_1}?\p"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3}!”\p"
"Whoa! Such a spectacular declaration!\p"
"The TRAINER's love for the {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"comes across loud and clear!$"
msgstr ""
"然后我们来看看……\n"
"那只{STR_VAR_2}到底是哪里\l"
"如此吸引{STR_VAR_1}呢？\p"
"…… …… …… ……\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3}！”\p"
"哇！多么壮丽的宣言！\p"
"训练家对{STR_VAR_2}的爱\n"
"表露无遗！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:411
msgctxt "gTVFanClubOpinionsText04"
msgid ""
"Hm? Oh, there's still more.\n"
"Let's check it out!\p"
"Let me see, now…\p"
"We asked {STR_VAR_1}, “What do POKéMON\n"
"mean to you?”\p"
"… … … … … …\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3}!”\p"
"Bravo!\p"
"That's the best shout I've had all day!\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3}!”\p"
"It makes you want to shout it out loud\n"
"again and again!\p"
"Now that we've had a great shout, it's\n"
"time to say good-bye until next time!\p"
"So, let's all have one last shout!\n"
"All together now…\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3}!”$"
msgstr ""
"嗯？哦，还有呢。\n"
"我们来看看！\p"
"让我看看……\p"
"我们问了{STR_VAR_1}：\n"
"“宝可梦对你来说意味着什么？”\p"
"…… …… ……\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3}！”\p"
"太棒了！\p"
"这是我今天听到最棒的呐喊！\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3}！”\p"
"让人忍不住想\n"
"一遍又一遍地大声喊出来！\p"
"痛快地喊完之后，\n"
"又到了说再见的时候了！\p"
"那么，大家最后再喊一次！\n"
"预备——\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3}！”$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:430
msgctxt "gTVFanClubText00"
msgid ""
"WE ARE THE POKéMON FAN CLUB!\p"
"We're on the air!\p"
"Today, we'll get rolling with the\n"
"POKéMON SURVEY CORNER.\p"
"Out of all the tales woven by POKéMON\n"
"and TRAINERS, what startling new drama\l"
"will grab our attention today?\p"
"Let me see…\p"
"This one!\p"
"We'll start with this letter!\p"
"It's a letter from {STR_VAR_1} about a\n"
"beloved {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"Let's see how passionately our writer\n"
"can express love for the {STR_VAR_2}!\l"
"Hmhm…$"
msgstr ""
"我们是宝可梦爱好者俱乐部！\p"
"节目开始啦！\p"
"今天，我们从\n"
"“宝可梦调查角”开始！\p"
"在宝可梦与训练家编织的\n"
"无数故事中，今天又有什么\l"
"惊人的新故事等着我们呢？\p"
"我看看……\p"
"就是这个！\p"
"先从这封信开始吧！\p"
"这是{STR_VAR_1}写来的信，\n"
"讲的是心爱的{STR_VAR_2}。\p"
"来看看这位写信人\n"
"有多爱{STR_VAR_2}吧！\l"
"嗯嗯……$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:447
msgctxt "gTVFanClubText01"
msgid ""
"Whoah!\n"
"What an amazing letter!$"
msgstr ""
"哇哦！\n"
"多么精彩的一封信！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:451
msgctxt "gTVFanClubText02"
msgid "I loved it, so here it is again!$"
msgstr "我太喜欢了，再念一遍！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:454
msgctxt "gTVFanClubText03"
msgid ""
"A great letter bears reading over\n"
"and over!$"
msgstr ""
"好信就是值得\n"
"一读再读！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:458
msgctxt "gTVFanClubText04"
msgid ""
"The bit “{STR_VAR_3},” that really\n"
"accentuates emotional impact!\p"
"It's a great letter that has real\n"
"heartfelt depth!$"
msgstr ""
"“{STR_VAR_3}”这一段，\n"
"真是大大增强了感染力！\p"
"这封信真是情真意切，\n"
"很有深度！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:464
msgctxt "gTVFanClubText05"
msgid ""
"Especially that “{STR_VAR_3}” bit!\p"
"I love how “{STR_VAR_3}” is used!$"
msgstr ""
"特别是“{STR_VAR_3}”那一段！\p"
"我好喜欢“{STR_VAR_3}”的用法！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:468
msgctxt "gTVFanClubText06"
msgid ""
"By the way, and it's not important,\n"
"but “{STR_VAR_3}” is a great saying.\p"
"I've been using “{STR_VAR_3}” a lot\n"
"in conversations lately.$"
msgstr ""
"顺便一提，虽然不太重要，\n"
"“{STR_VAR_3}”真是一句好话。\p"
"我最近聊天的时候\n"
"也常常说“{STR_VAR_3}”呢。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:474
msgctxt "gTVFanClubText07"
msgid ""
"If I had to score this letter,\n"
"I'd give it {STR_VAR_3} points.\p"
"Next time, I'll be expecting an even\n"
"better letter, {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"A-whoops, will you look at the time?\n"
"Time to say good-bye until next time!$"
msgstr ""
"如果要给这封信打分，\n"
"我会给{STR_VAR_3}分。\p"
"下次我会期待一封\n"
"更棒的信哦，{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"哎呀，看看时间！\n"
"又到了说再见的时候了！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:482
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_InterviewRequest"
msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"Do you perhaps like POKéMON?\p"
"I'm on assignment with the TV network.\p"
"I'm gathering stories on POKéMON and\n"
"TRAINERS that occurred recently.\p"
"If you don't mind, could you tell me\n"
"something about yourself?$"
msgstr ""
"哦？\n"
"你是不是喜欢宝可梦？\p"
"我是受电视台委托来的。\p"
"我正在收集最近发生的\n"
"有关宝可梦和训练家的故事。\p"
"如果你不介意的话，\n"
"能跟我讲讲你自己的事吗？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:491
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_InterviewRequestShort"
msgid ""
"I'm gathering stories on POKéMON and\n"
"TRAINERS that occurred recently.\p"
"If you don't mind, could you tell me\n"
"something about yourself?$"
msgstr ""
"我正在收集最近发生的\n"
"有关宝可梦和训练家的故事。\p"
"如果你不介意的话，\n"
"能跟我讲讲你自己的事吗？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:497
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_TellMeExperienceInvolvingPokemon"
msgid ""
"Oh, you will?\n"
"Thank you!\p"
"Then, please, tell me anything of\n"
"interest that you experienced recently\l"
"involving POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你愿意吗？\n"
"谢谢你！\p"
"那么，请告诉我你最近\n"
"和宝可梦有关的\l"
"有趣经历吧。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:504
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_LetMeKnowIfYouHaveStory"
msgid ""
"Oh, I see…\p"
"Well, if you do have an interesting\n"
"story to tell, please let me know.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，这样啊……\p"
"如果你有什么有趣的故事，\n"
"请一定要告诉我哦。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:509
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_ThatsAllForInterview"
msgid ""
"Oh, what an uplifting story!\p"
"I'll be sure to get your story told\n"
"on television.\p"
"It should be aired sometime, I think,\n"
"so please look forward to it.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，真是振奋人心的故事！\p"
"我一定会让你的故事\n"
"在电视上播出。\p"
"应该过一阵子就会播了，\n"
"敬请期待吧。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:516
msgctxt "SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_1F_Text_BetterWriteUpStory"
msgid ""
"Hmmm…\n"
"I've got a good story for a TV program.\p"
"I'd better write it up in a hurry!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……\n"
"我拿到了适合做节目的好故事。\p"
"得赶紧把它写出来！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:521
msgctxt "gTVRecentHappeningsText00"
msgid ""
"Hello, it's time for RECENT HAPPENINGS.\p"
"For POKéMON TRAINERS, every day\n"
"is a storybook tale.\p"
"What we want to do is to introduce you\n"
"to some of these POKéMON tales.\p"
"Today, we bring you the story\n"
"of the TRAINER {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"What did {STR_VAR_1} experience recently?\n"
"Let's find out.\p"
"Let's see…$"
msgstr ""
"大家好，“近况报道”时间到了。\p"
"对宝可梦训练家来说，\n"
"每一天都是一个故事。\p"
"我们想为大家介绍\n"
"其中的一些宝可梦故事。\p"
"今天要讲的，\n"
"是训练家{STR_VAR_1}的故事。\p"
"{STR_VAR_1}最近经历了什么呢？\n"
"我们来看看吧。\p"
"我看看……$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:533
msgctxt "gTVRecentHappeningsText01"
msgid ""
"Wasn't that enlightening?\p"
"The story gives you a clear idea of what\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} has experienced recently.\l"
"It's as if we were there as witnesses!$"
msgstr ""
"是不是很有启发呢？\p"
"从这个故事中，可以清楚地了解\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}最近的经历。\l"
"就好像我们亲眼目睹了一样！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:539
msgctxt "gTVRecentHappeningsText02"
msgid ""
"“{STR_VAR_3}.” That\n"
"accents the tale and gives it depth.$"
msgstr ""
"“{STR_VAR_3}。”这一句\n"
"为故事增添了深度。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:543
msgctxt "gTVRecentHappeningsText03"
msgid ""
"“{STR_VAR_3}.”\n"
"That gives the tale a sense of place.\l"
"It lets us envision the tale's setting.$"
msgstr ""
"“{STR_VAR_3}。”\n"
"这一句让故事有了画面感，\l"
"让我们能想象出故事的场景。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:548
msgctxt "gTVRecentHappeningsText04"
msgid ""
"The “{STR_VAR_3}”\n"
"section of the tale is very expressive.$"
msgstr ""
"故事中“{STR_VAR_3}”\n"
"这一段非常有表现力。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:552
msgctxt "gTVRecentHappeningsText05"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} has recounted a wonderful\n"
"tale involving POKéMON.\p"
"And now {STR_VAR_1}'s tale is indelibly\n"
"etched into your soul, too.\p"
"That's it for today.\n"
"Please tune in next time.$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}讲述了一个\n"
"与宝可梦有关的精彩故事。\p"
"现在，{STR_VAR_1}的故事\n"
"也深深刻在了你的心里。\p"
"今天的节目就到这里。\n"
"请继续收看下一期。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:560
msgctxt "gTVMassOutbreakText00"
msgid ""
"Greetings!\n"
"It's time for POKéMON NEWS.\p"
"We've just received word of a very\n"
"rare occurrence.\p"
"There have been reports of a mass\n"
"outbreak of {STR_VAR_2} in the vicinity\l"
"of {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}, as you're probably aware,\n"
"is known as a POKéMON that's rare\l"
"and hard to find.\p"
"It sounds like a rare opportunity to\n"
"see the mystifying outbreak of\l"
"{STR_VAR_2} in the wild.\p"
"That's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"
msgstr ""
"大家好！\n"
"“宝可梦新闻”时间到了。\p"
"我们刚刚收到消息，\n"
"发生了一件非常罕见的事。\p"
"据报道，{STR_VAR_1}附近\n"
"出现了大量的{STR_VAR_2}。\p"
"大家可能都知道，{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"是一种稀有又难找的宝可梦。\p"
"这可是在野外观察{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"神秘大量出现的难得机会。\p"
"以上就是“宝可梦新闻”。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:576
msgctxt "gTV3CheersForPokeblocksText00"
msgid ""
"MC: We hope you're in good cheer,\n"
"“3 CHEERS FOR {POKEBLOCK}S” is here!\p"
"Today, we examine the {POKEBLOCK} blended\n"
"by {STR_VAR_1} and associates.\p"
"Without any delay, let me feed it\n"
"to my gourmet POKéMON GULPIN.\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""
"主持人：大家心情好吗？\n"
"“为{POKEBLOCK}欢呼三声”开播啦！\p"
"今天我们要品鉴的，是{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"和朋友们一起混合出的{POKEBLOCK}。\p"
"话不多说，马上拿给我的\n"
"美食家宝可梦溶食兽尝尝。\p"
"…… …… ……\n"
"…… …… ……$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:586
msgctxt "gTV3CheersForPokeblocksText01"
msgid ""
"GULPIN: Gubi! Gubii!\p"
"MC: And the verdict is very {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"GULPIN says it tastes “{STR_VAR_2}!”\p"
"Thank you so much, {STR_VAR_3}!$"
msgstr ""
"溶食兽：咕比！咕比比！\p"
"主持人：评价是——非常{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"溶食兽说味道“{STR_VAR_2}！”\p"
"非常感谢你，{STR_VAR_3}！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:592
msgctxt "gTV3CheersForPokeblocksText02"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}'s blending performance\n"
"left something to be desired.\p"
"If this TRAINER could blend better,\n"
"the {POKEBLOCK} would be much tastier.$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}的混合技术\n"
"还有待加强。\p"
"如果这位训练家能混合得更好，\n"
"{POKEBLOCK}一定会更好吃。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:598
msgctxt "gTV3CheersForPokeblocksText03"
msgid ""
"GULPIN: Gubi! Gubii!\p"
"MC: Hmm… It's too {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"GULPIN says it tastes “{STR_VAR_2}!”\p"
"It looks like {STR_VAR_3}'s errors\n"
"hurt the blending quality…$"
msgstr ""
"溶食兽：咕比！咕比比！\p"
"主持人：嗯……太{STR_VAR_1}了。\n"
"溶食兽说味道“{STR_VAR_2}！”\p"
"看来是{STR_VAR_3}的失误\n"
"影响了混合的品质……$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:605
msgctxt "gTV3CheersForPokeblocksText04"
msgid ""
"It's too bad that {STR_VAR_1}'s\n"
"leading effort went to waste.\p"
"Let's hope {STR_VAR_2} can turn in\n"
"a better showing next time!$"
msgstr ""
"真可惜，{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"带头的努力白费了。\p"
"希望{STR_VAR_2}下次\n"
"能有更好的表现！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:611
msgctxt "gTV3CheersForPokeblocksText05"
msgid ""
"Tune in next time!\n"
"Our slogan is “3 CHEERS FOR {POKEBLOCK}S!”$"
msgstr ""
"下次也请继续收看！\n"
"口号是“为{POKEBLOCK}欢呼三声！”$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:615
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_WhatsYourOpinionOfTrainer"
msgid ""
"Hi, there!\p"
"I'm a big fan of {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"What's your opinion of {STR_VAR_1}?$"
msgstr ""
"你好啊！\p"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的忠实粉丝。\n"
"你觉得{STR_VAR_1}怎么样？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:620
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_ThatsWhatYouThink"
msgid ""
"I see, I see. That's what you think\n"
"about the TRAINER.$"
msgstr ""
"原来如此，原来如此。\n"
"你是这么看那位训练家的啊。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:624
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_HaveYouForgottenTrainer"
msgid ""
"Have you completely forgotten\n"
"about {STR_VAR_1}?$"
msgstr ""
"你已经完全忘记\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}了吗？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:628
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_WhatsYourOpinionOfTrainer2"
msgid ""
"I'm a big fan of {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"What's your opinion of {STR_VAR_1}?$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的忠实粉丝。\n"
"你觉得{STR_VAR_1}怎么样？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:632
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_HowStrongRateTrainer"
msgid ""
"How strong would you rate {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"on a scale of one hundred?$"
msgstr ""
"如果满分是一百分，\n"
"你觉得{STR_VAR_1}有多强？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:636
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_HaveYouForgottenTrainer2"
msgid ""
"Have you completely forgotten\n"
"about {STR_VAR_1}?$"
msgstr ""
"你已经完全忘记\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}了吗？$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:640
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_YouShouldMeetTrainer"
msgid ""
"Oh, I see!\n"
"You should meet {STR_VAR_1} sometime.\l"
"I'm sure you'll become a fan, too!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，原来如此！\n"
"你有空应该见见{STR_VAR_1}。\l"
"你一定也会成为粉丝的！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:645
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_ThankYouIllShareThisInfo"
msgid ""
"I see, I see.\p"
"Thank you!\n"
"That's very useful to know.\p"
"I'll share this information with other\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} fans and discuss it.$"
msgstr ""
"原来如此，原来如此。\p"
"谢谢你！\n"
"这些信息很有用。\p"
"我会和其他{STR_VAR_1}的粉丝\n"
"分享这些信息，好好讨论一下。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:652
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_HopeYouCatchTVSpecial"
msgid ""
"There's going to be a TV special on\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} very soon.\p"
"I hope you catch it!$"
msgstr ""
"电视上马上就要播出\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}的特别节目了。\p"
"希望你能收看哦！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:657
msgctxt "gTVTrainerFanClubSpecialText00"
msgid ""
"TRAINER FAN CLUB\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} SPECIAL!\p"
"This is a special presentation for\n"
"the fans of {STR_VAR_1} all over HOENN!\p"
"Today, we ask the question, “What do\n"
"people think of {STR_VAR_1}?”\p"
"We posed the question to {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"as the TRAINER representative.\p"
"We asked, “In one word, how would\n"
"you describe {STR_VAR_1}?”\p"
"The reply: “{STR_VAR_3}.”\p"
"Kudos to {STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"What a perceptive opinion!\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3} {STR_VAR_1}.”\n"
"It has such a nice ring to it!\p"
"{STR_VAR_2} also scored {STR_VAR_1}'s\n"
"strength from 0 to 100.$"
msgstr ""
"训练家粉丝俱乐部\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}特辑！\p"
"这是为丰缘各地{STR_VAR_1}的粉丝\n"
"特别献上的节目！\p"
"今天我们要问的是：\n"
"“大家怎么看{STR_VAR_1}？”\p"
"我们请{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"作为训练家代表回答这个问题。\p"
"我们问道：“如果用一个词\n"
"来形容{STR_VAR_1}，你会怎么说？”\p"
"回答是：“{STR_VAR_3}。”\p"
"为{STR_VAR_2}喝彩！\n"
"多么敏锐的见解！\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3}的{STR_VAR_1}。”\n"
"听起来真顺耳！\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}还给{STR_VAR_1}的实力\n"
"打了分，满分是100分。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:676
msgctxt "gTVTrainerFanClubSpecialText01"
msgid ""
"The score was {STR_VAR_3} points!\n"
"That is a very high score indeed!\p"
"{STR_VAR_2} must obviously hold\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} in very high esteem.$"
msgstr ""
"分数是{STR_VAR_3}分！\n"
"真是非常高的分数！\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}显然非常敬重\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}呢。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:682
msgctxt "gTVTrainerFanClubSpecialText02"
msgid ""
"The score was {STR_VAR_3} points!\n"
"That is quite a good score.\p"
"{STR_VAR_2} must consider\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} to be a rival.$"
msgstr ""
"分数是{STR_VAR_3}分！\n"
"相当不错的分数。\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}一定是把{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"当成了劲敌。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:688
msgctxt "gTVTrainerFanClubSpecialText03"
msgid ""
"The score was {STR_VAR_3} points!\n"
"That's a rather weak score.\p"
"{STR_VAR_2} must consider\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} to be a mere sidekick.$"
msgstr ""
"分数是{STR_VAR_3}分！\n"
"分数有点低啊。\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}大概只把{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"当成了跟班。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:694
msgctxt "gTVTrainerFanClubSpecialText04"
msgid ""
"The score was {STR_VAR_3} point(s)!\n"
"That's a terrible score.\p"
"{STR_VAR_2} must consider\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} to be an underling.$"
msgstr ""
"分数是{STR_VAR_3}分！\n"
"这分数也太惨了。\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}大概把{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"当成了小喽啰。$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:700
msgctxt "gTVTrainerFanClubSpecialText05"
msgid ""
"There you have it, folks!\p"
"I think we all learned something\n"
"new about {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"In closing, I'll leave you with\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}'s words.\p"
"{STR_VAR_3} {STR_VAR_1}!$"
msgstr ""
"各位观众，以上就是今天的内容！\p"
"我想大家都对{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"有了新的认识。\p"
"最后，就用{STR_VAR_2}的话\n"
"来结束今天的节目吧。\p"
"“{STR_VAR_3}的{STR_VAR_1}”！$"

#: data/text/tv.inc:708
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText00"
msgid ""
"And now, it's time for…\n"
"THE NAME RATER SHOW.\p"
"I tell your POKéMON's fortune from\n"
"the nickname you've bestowed.\p"
"Advice is what I have to give, and it is\n"
"helpful advice that I offer.\p"
"Today, I shall do a reading of\n"
"the nickname {STR_VAR_3} of {STR_VAR_1}'s\l"
"POKéMON {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"Hmhm…\p"
"Hmm…\n"
"This nickname is…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:722
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText01"
msgid ""
"A nickname that hints at talent in many\n"
"different ways.\p"
"I urge this TRAINER to take courage\n"
"and take on many challenges.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:728
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText02"
msgid ""
"A nickname that perfectly complements\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}, the TRAINER's name.\p"
"It suggests that you will forge a fine\n"
"partnership with precise timing.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:734
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText03"
msgid ""
"A nickname fit for a unique individual\n"
"of a POKéMON!\p"
"If raised properly, this POKéMON's\n"
"uniqueness will bloom excessively!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:740
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText04"
msgid ""
"A nickname that will nurture the caring\n"
"and compassionate side of POKéMON.\p"
"If raised properly, this POKéMON will\n"
"come to exhibit real warmth!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:746
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText05"
msgid ""
"A very fine nickname that hints at\n"
"greatness to come.\p"
"I am intrigued about what the future\n"
"holds in store for this POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:752
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText06"
msgid ""
"A good nickname that should make the\n"
"POKéMON hale and hearty!\p"
"That POKéMON should remain fit and\n"
"robust for a long, long time.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:758
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText07"
msgid ""
"A good nickname that should make the\n"
"POKéMON very active!\p"
"I should think that this POKéMON will be\n"
"a strong performer in battles.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:764
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText08"
msgid ""
"An appealing nickname that should make\n"
"the POKéMON very charming!\p"
"I don't doubt that this POKéMON will be\n"
"quite the charmer in POKéMON CONTESTS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:770
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText09"
msgid ""
"The nickname {STR_VAR_1} is rooted by\n"
"the letter “{STR_VAR_3}.”\p"
"That letter is supported by the first\n"
"letter “{STR_VAR_2},” which gives it a solid sense\l"
"of presence as a nickname.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:777
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText10"
msgid ""
"The nickname {STR_VAR_1} is very\n"
"shapely in a pleasing manner.\p"
"The presence of the letters “{STR_VAR_2}” and\n"
"“{STR_VAR_3}”--now that is remarkably good!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:783
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText11"
msgid ""
"The nickname {STR_VAR_1}--it has a\n"
"sublime, flowing feel to it.\p"
"The flow from the initial letter “{STR_VAR_2}” to\n"
"“{STR_VAR_3}” is especially wonderful.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:789
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText12"
msgid ""
"Let's examine other examples of fine\n"
"nicknames, shall we?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:793
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText13"
msgid ""
"Try this example. Take a part of the\n"
"TRAINER name of {STR_VAR_1}, and end\l"
"up with the fine nickname {STR_VAR_2}{STR_VAR_3}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:798
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText14"
msgid ""
"The nickname {STR_VAR_2}{STR_VAR_3} would also work\n"
"quite well.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:802
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText15"
msgid ""
"The POKéMON's species name of\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} could be used as the basis\l"
"for making the nickname {STR_VAR_1}{STR_VAR_3}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:807
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText16"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}{STR_VAR_3} would also be an effective\n"
"nickname.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:811
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText17"
msgid ""
"What should always be avoided is using\n"
"another POKéMON species name.\p"
"For instance, avoid taking the name of\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} to make the nickname {STR_VAR_1}{STR_VAR_3}.\l"
"That is unacceptable.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:818
msgctxt "gTVNameRaterText18"
msgid ""
"I must say that {STR_VAR_1} is quite\n"
"a good nickname.\p"
"I hope that the TRAINER will continue\n"
"to treat {STR_VAR_1} with love.\p"
"That's it for today's show.\n"
"May we meet again.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:826
msgctxt "gTVPokemonAnglerText00"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2} ANGLER\p"
"ANNOUNCER: Hello! Today, we'll get tips\n"
"on fishing for {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"GURU, what advice can you give for\n"
"catching {STR_VAR_2}?\p"
"GURU: Hm? Catching {STR_VAR_2}?\n"
"Well, let me tell you, be patient and\l"
"wait. That's the bottom line.\p"
"Do you see {STR_VAR_1} over there?\n"
"That TRAINER makes a good example.\p"
"That TRAINER's already had\n"
"{STR_VAR_3} POKéMON get away.\p"
"But there {STR_VAR_1} waits. No giving up.\n"
"That's the law for catching {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"ANNOUNCER: I see…\p"
"Oh! {STR_VAR_1} has finally landed an\n"
"elusive {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"The TRAINER appears close to tears\n"
"out of sheer joy!\p"
"Seeing that elated look, I'm getting\n"
"the itch to go fishing, too!\p"
"Viewers, why not take this as a cue to\n"
"try some {STR_VAR_2} fishing?\p"
"Until our next broadcast, farewell and\n"
"good fishing to you all!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:853
msgctxt "gTVPokemonAnglerText01"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2} ANGLER\p"
"ANNOUNCER: Hello! Today, we'll get tips\n"
"on fishing for {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"GURU, what advice can you give for\n"
"catching {STR_VAR_2}?\p"
"GURU: Hm? Catching {STR_VAR_2}?\n"
"Well, let me tell you, use your fishing\l"
"ROD with vigor!\p"
"Do you see {STR_VAR_1} over there?\n"
"See how the ROD is handled?\p"
"That TRAINER's already caught\n"
"{STR_VAR_3} in a row.\p"
"ANNOUNCER: It's incredible!\n"
"It looks like a storm…\p"
"Seeing technique of that caliber, I'm\n"
"getting the itch to go fishing, too.\p"
"Viewers, why not take this as a cue to\n"
"try some {STR_VAR_2} fishing?\p"
"Until our next broadcast, farewell and\n"
"good fishing to you all!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:875
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodayFailedText00"
msgid ""
"Hello!\p"
"It's time for POKéMON TODAY!\p"
"BIG SIS: Hi! Is everyone peachy and\n"
"perky today?\p"
"Today, we're going to look at {STR_VAR_1}'s\n"
"POKéMON {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"BIG BRO: Yeah! That's what we're going\n"
"to do!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:885
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodayFailedText01"
msgid ""
"Oh!\n"
"Speaking of {STR_VAR_1}…\p"
"BIG SIS, I saw the TRAINER with my very\n"
"own eyes!\p"
"BIG SIS: Oh, what did you see?\p"
"BIG BRO: Well, I had to go on a trip to\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"That's when I happened to come across\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}, who was trying to catch the\l"
"POKéMON {STR_VAR_3}, but…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:897
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodayFailedText02"
msgid ""
"The POKéMON managed to get away!\p"
"It ended up wasting this many\n"
"POKé BALLS: {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"You should have seen the expression\n"
"of frustration on {STR_VAR_1}'s face when\l"
"the POKéMON took off!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:905
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodayFailedText03"
msgid ""
"But {STR_VAR_1} goofed and made the\n"
"POKéMON faint!\p"
"It ended up wasting this many\n"
"POKé BALLS: {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"You should have seen the expression\n"
"of stunned dismay on {STR_VAR_1}'s face\l"
"when the POKéMON fainted!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:914
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodayFailedText04"
msgid ""
"BIG SIS: Hey, there!\n"
"That's not nice!\p"
"You shouldn't be laughing at other\n"
"people's misfortune!\p"
"Oh, poor {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"What a shame!\p"
"BIG BRO: That's true!\n"
"Sorry for laughing.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:924
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodayFailedText05"
msgid ""
"BIG SIS: Bufufu…\p"
"BIG BRO: Hey!\n"
"You just laughed, too!\p"
"BIG SIS: Huh?!\p"
"I didn't laugh!\n"
"Honestly, I didn't!\p"
"Oh, poor {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"What a shame!\p"
"BIG BRO: …$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:935
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodayFailedText06"
msgid ""
"BIG SIS: That's enough silliness!\n"
"Let's look at today's POKéMON…\p"
"Huh?\n"
"We're out of time already?\p"
"Aww!\n"
"We couldn't profile a POKéMON today!\p"
"BIG BRO: See you again next time!\p"
"BIG SIS: Hey, don't end the show\n"
"without me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:946
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText00"
msgid ""
"Hello!\p"
"It's time for POKéMON TODAY!\p"
"BIG SIS: Hi! Is everyone peachy and\n"
"perky today?\p"
"Today, we're going to look at {STR_VAR_1}'s\n"
"POKéMON {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"BIG BRO: Yeah! That's what we're going\n"
"to do!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:956
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText01"
msgid ""
"BIG SIS: {STR_VAR_1} gave the nickname\n"
"{STR_VAR_3} to the {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"It sounds like {STR_VAR_3} is getting\n"
"good, loving care!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:962
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText02"
msgid ""
"BIG BRO: The TRAINER had to throw this\n"
"many POKé BALLS to catch it: {STR_VAR_3}!\p"
"It finally took a single {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"to catch it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:968
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText03"
msgid ""
"BIG SIS: If it was that easy to catch,\n"
"it must have been destiny that brought\l"
"{STR_VAR_1} and the {STR_VAR_2} together!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:973
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText04"
msgid ""
"BIG SIS: Wow! That's so neat!\p"
"But you know what they say, a POKéMON\n"
"that takes a lot of effort to catch\l"
"earns the love of its TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:979
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText05"
msgid ""
"BIG SIS: {STR_VAR_1}'s {STR_VAR_2} is a\n"
"memorable POKéMON because it took an\l"
"invaluable MASTER BALL to catch!\p"
"BIG BRO: Wow! That's mega-awesome!\p"
"BIG SIS: {STR_VAR_1} must have really\n"
"wanted that {STR_VAR_2}, for sure!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:987
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText06"
msgid ""
"BIG BRO: Then to give the nickname\n"
"{STR_VAR_3} to that {STR_VAR_2}…\p"
"You really get a good idea about\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}'s TRAINER sense.\p"
"BIG SIS: I second that notion!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:994
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText07"
msgid ""
"If it were me, I'd give that nickname\n"
"to something like this {STR_VAR_3}!\p"
"BIG BRO: Whoa! That could be the start\n"
"of something new!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1000
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText08"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2} the {STR_VAR_1}?\n"
"Doesn't that sound perfect?\p"
"The letters and everything--they\n"
"sound just right for the POKéMON\l"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"BIG BRO: Yeah, true, that!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1008
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText09"
msgid ""
"As far as I know, no TRAINER has ever\n"
"given the nickname {STR_VAR_2} to their\l"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"BIG BRO: That just goes to show what\n"
"great taste the TRAINER has in picking\l"
"nicknames!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1016
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText10"
msgid ""
"The next time I catch a POKéMON,\n"
"I should give it the name {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"BIG BRO: Huh? Me, too!\n"
"I'll use the nickname {STR_VAR_2}, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1022
msgctxt "gTVPokemonTodaySuccessfulText11"
msgid ""
"BIG SIS: Oh, no!\n"
"Look at the time!\p"
"Well, gang, this is it for today.\n"
"See you again next time!\p"
"BIG BRO: Remember, it could be your\n"
"POKéMON in the spotlight next time!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1030
msgctxt "SmartShopper_Text_Intro"
msgid ""
"Hello!\p"
"It's time for TODAY'S SMART SHOPPER.\p"
"INTERVIEWER: How are you, viewers?\p"
"Today we're visiting a shop\n"
"in {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"Let's check on what the hot sellers\n"
"have been recently.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1039
msgctxt "SmartShopper_Text_ClerkNormal"
msgid ""
"Let's interview the clerk to get the\n"
"lowdown.\p"
"Hi, how's your business?\p"
"CLERK: Oh, we're doing excellent.\p"
"Recently, {STR_VAR_2} has been\n"
"selling especially strongly.\p"
"Why, just the other day a TRAINER\n"
"named {STR_VAR_1} bought {STR_VAR_3}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1049
msgctxt "SmartShopper_Text_RandomComment1"
msgid ""
"INTERVIEWER: The TRAINER bought\n"
"{STR_VAR_3} {STR_VAR_2}S? That's a haul!\p"
"If I may say so, {STR_VAR_1} must have\n"
"been stocking up for a long journey\l"
"to far-off places.\p"
"For traveling, {STR_VAR_2}S are so\n"
"important!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1058
msgctxt "SmartShopper_Text_RandomComment2"
msgid ""
"INTERVIEWER: Speaking of the item\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}, I just bought {STR_VAR_3} of\l"
"them recently.\p"
"After all, {STR_VAR_2}'s a great item!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1064
msgctxt "SmartShopper_Text_RandomComment3"
msgid ""
"INTERVIEWER: {STR_VAR_2}?!\n"
"But {STR_VAR_3} of them?!\p"
"I didn't think there would be anyone\n"
"buying that many.\p"
"My goodness, I can only afford one or\n"
"two at a time…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1072
msgctxt "SmartShopper_Text_RandomComment4"
msgid ""
"INTERVIEWER: One time, I bought\n"
"a whole lot of the item {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"But it turned out to be too many.\n"
"I ended up regretting it…\p"
"Since then, I only buy strictly what\n"
"I absolutely need…\p"
"Oops!\p"
"There's no point talking about me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1082
msgctxt "SmartShopper_Text_SecondItem"
msgid ""
"CLERK: {STR_VAR_1} also bought the item\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} in bulk, taking {STR_VAR_3}.\p"
"INTERVIEWER: Oh, that's smart.\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}'s a very good item, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1088
msgctxt "SmartShopper_Text_ThirdItem"
msgid ""
"CLERK: And, the TRAINER also bought\n"
"{STR_VAR_3} of the item {STR_VAR_2}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1092
msgctxt "SmartShopper_Text_DuringSale"
msgid ""
"CLERK: Plus, it was during a big sale.\n"
"That's smart shopping.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1096
msgctxt "SmartShopper_Text_OutroNormal"
msgid ""
"INTERVIEWER: Hmm… {STR_VAR_1} sounds like\n"
"quite the shrewd bargain hunter!\p"
"In total, {STR_VAR_1}'s purchases came to…\p"
"¥{STR_VAR_2}?!\n"
"What an amazing sum!\p"
"Oops! We're out of time!\n"
"See you on our next broadcast!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1105
msgctxt "SmartShopper_Text_IsVIP"
msgid ""
"CLERK: {STR_VAR_1} is a VIP customer,\n"
"no doubt about it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1109
msgctxt "SmartShopper_Text_ClerkMax"
msgid ""
"Let's interview the clerk to get the\n"
"lowdown.\p"
"Hi, how's your business?\p"
"CLERK: Oh, we're doing unbelievable\n"
"business. It's almost overwhelming.\p"
"Recently, a TRAINER named {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"bought the item {STR_VAR_2} in bulk.\p"
"The TRAINER almost cleared out our\n"
"entire stock of {STR_VAR_2}S.\p"
"I never dreamt that any customer\n"
"would ever need so many {STR_VAR_2}S.\l"
"It's just unheard of!\p"
"INTERVIEWER: So that would be like 100\n"
"or 200 sold?\p"
"CLERK: Oh, no, much more than that!\p"
"INTERVIEWER: Oh, my goodness!\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} must be a special shopper!\p"
"CLERK: {STR_VAR_1} is a VIP customer,\n"
"no doubt about it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1130
msgctxt "SmartShopper_Text_OutroMax"
msgid ""
"INTERVIEWER: Hmm…\n"
"That is amazing.\p"
"But why would the TRAINER need to buy\n"
"so many?\p"
"… …\p"
"The mystery deepens, but this is all\n"
"the time we have today.\l"
"See you on our next broadcast!\p"
"Still, {STR_VAR_1} is certainly an enigma…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1141
msgctxt "gTVWorldOfMastersText00"
msgid ""
"THE WORLD OF MASTERS\p"
"Hello, viewers.\p"
"Perhaps you are aware of a TRAINER\n"
"named {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} is famous as a master at\n"
"catching POKéMON.\p"
"{STR_VAR_1}'s quest for POKéMON depends\n"
"entirely on a careful search on foot.\p"
"On one memorable day, the TRAINER\n"
"walked some {STR_VAR_2} steps.\p"
"The total number of POKéMON caught\n"
"that day reached an impressive {STR_VAR_3}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1155
msgctxt "gTVWorldOfMastersText01"
msgid ""
"That remarkable feat must have been\n"
"possible because of the trust between\l"
"the TRAINER and {STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1160
msgctxt "gTVWorldOfMastersText02"
msgid ""
"The master caught the day's last\n"
"{STR_VAR_3} near {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"That POKéMON apparently enjoys\n"
"a special status as a record holder.\p"
"Skilled TRAINERS should be encouraged\n"
"to challenge this fine record.\p"
"That's all for today.\n"
"Please tune in next time.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1170
msgctxt "gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText00"
msgid ""
"TODAY'S RIVAL TRAINER!\p"
"Hello, fellow POKéMON TRAINERS!\n"
"How are we all doing today?\p"
"Today, like every other day,\n"
"we'll examine one of our rivals!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1177
msgctxt "gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText07"
msgid ""
"Today's rival TRAINER is {STR_VAR_1},\n"
"who's around {STR_VAR_3} now.\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} has so far registered\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON in the POKéDEX.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1183
msgctxt "gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText08"
msgid ""
"Today's rival TRAINER is {STR_VAR_1},\n"
"who's in a SECRET BASE now.\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} has so far registered\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON in the POKéDEX.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1189
msgctxt "gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText09"
msgid ""
"Today's rival TRAINER is {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"So far, {STR_VAR_1} has registered\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON in the POKéDEX.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1194
msgctxt "gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText10"
msgid ""
"Today's rival TRAINER is {STR_VAR_1},\n"
"who's on a ferry now.\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} has so far registered\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON in the POKéDEX.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1202
msgctxt "gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText01"
msgid ""
"And how many BADGES does our rival\n"
"have? The number is {STR_VAR_1}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1206
msgctxt "gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText02"
msgid ""
"But our rival hasn't obtained\n"
"a single BADGE yet!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1210
msgctxt "gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText03"
msgid ""
"Our rival hasn't obtained a single\n"
"BATTLE FRONTIER Symbol yet.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1214
msgctxt "gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText04"
msgid ""
"Let's see how many BATTLE FRONTIER\n"
"Symbols our rival has.\p"
"Gold Symbols: {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"Silver Symbols: {STR_VAR_2}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1220
msgctxt "gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText05"
msgid ""
"Our rival has collected {STR_VAR_1} Battle\n"
"Point(s) at the BATTLE FRONTIER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1224
msgctxt "gTVTodaysRivalTrainerText06"
msgid ""
"So, how did you measure up in\n"
"comparison to {STR_VAR_1}?\p"
"The adventure rolls on!\p"
"Fellow TRAINERS!\p"
"Let's all keep moving forward\n"
"and ahead of our rivals!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1232
msgctxt "TrendWatcher_Text_Intro"
msgid ""
"DEWFORD TREND-WATCHER NETWORK!\p"
"MC: Wassup?\n"
"We'll keep it real with the latest on\l"
"what's hip and happening in DEWFORD.\p"
"Our guest today is this old cat whose\n"
"claim to fame is being the authority\l"
"on all things in DEWFORD.\p"
"Old man: Glad to be here.\p"
"MC: Let's cut to the chase, right on.\p"
"What's your word on what's groovin'\n"
"the good folks of DEWFORD?\p"
"Old man: {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"MC: {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2},\n"
"you say?\p"
"Old man: No.\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2} never\n"
"did get popular at all.\p"
"Would you like to hear about it?\p"
"MC: Uh, no. What we want to know is\n"
"what's the in thing of the moment…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1255
msgctxt "TrendWatcher_Text_MaleTaughtMePhrase"
msgid ""
"Old man: {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"was what {STR_VAR_3} from LITTLEROOT\l"
"taught me as being trendy…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1260
msgctxt "TrendWatcher_Text_FemaleTaughtMePhrase"
msgid ""
"Old man: {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"was what {STR_VAR_3} from LITTLEROOT\l"
"taught me as being trendy…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1265
msgctxt "TrendWatcher_Text_PhraseWasHopeless"
msgid ""
"But it was utterly hopeless.\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2} festival!\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2} contest!\p"
"I tried teaching everyone the best\n"
"I could, but…\p"
"Perhaps the {STR_VAR_1} part just\n"
"wasn't right…\p"
"MC: Uh, excuse me, compadre, I need\n"
"to hear about what's in now…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1277
msgctxt "TrendWatcher_Text_MaleTellMeBigger"
msgid ""
"Old man: {STR_VAR_3}!\n"
"Please, tell me something bigger than\l"
"that {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1282
msgctxt "TrendWatcher_Text_FemaleTellMeBigger"
msgid ""
"Old man: {STR_VAR_3}!\n"
"Please, tell me something bigger than\l"
"that {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1287
msgctxt "TrendWatcher_Text_Outro"
msgid ""
"MC: …Uh… So, there you have it,\n"
"all you trendy, hep cats out there!\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}…uh…\n"
"Didn't get hip or happening in DEWFORD!\p"
"My time is up. Catch you on the fly!\p"
"Old man: {STR_VAR_1} {STR_VAR_2}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1295
msgctxt "gTVHoennTreasureInvestigatorsText00"
msgid ""
"HOENN TREASURE INVESTIGATORS!\p"
"Hi, gang!\n"
"Score any secret items lately?\p"
"As always, we'll examine eyewitness\n"
"reports of secrets from all over!\p"
"Let's start with a letter.\n"
"It says, “{STR_VAR_1} discovered!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1304
msgctxt "gTVHoennTreasureInvestigatorsText01"
msgid ""
"Wow, we'd better check this letter\n"
"out! Let me read it to you.\p"
"…Dear INVESTIGATORS,\n"
"I hope you are well.\p"
"I recently saw {STR_VAR_2} somewhere\n"
"around {STR_VAR_3}.\p"
"The TRAINER found the item\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}. It made me envious.\p"
"…Well, good going, {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"Viewers, let that motivate you to\n"
"fire up your ITEMFINDERS and search!\p"
"I'll be waiting for exciting news\n"
"from all of you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1319
msgctxt "gTVHoennTreasureInvestigatorsText02"
msgid ""
"Wow, we'd better check this letter\n"
"out! Let me read it to you.\p"
"…Dear INVESTIGATORS,\n"
"I hope you are well.\p"
"I recently saw {STR_VAR_2} on a ferry.\p"
"The TRAINER found the item\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}. It made me envious.\p"
"…Well, good going, {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"Viewers, let that motivate you to\n"
"fire up your ITEMFINDERS and search!\p"
"I'll be waiting for exciting news\n"
"from all of you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1333
msgctxt "gTVFindThatGamerText00"
msgid ""
"FIND THAT GAMER!\p"
"Hey, all you gamers!\n"
"How's your {STR_VAR_2} spinning?\p"
"Like always, we'll cast our spotlight\n"
"on a rare TRAINER who's visited the\l"
"GAME CORNER!\p"
"Today, our no. 1 gamer is…\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1343
msgctxt "gTVFindThatGamerText01"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} played the {STR_VAR_2} game\n"
"and won a rare {STR_VAR_3} COINS.\p"
"“When {STR_VAR_1} comes, we need to\n"
"make sure we have enough COINS.”\p"
"That's what the GAME CORNER clerks\n"
"mutter when our gamer is in play!\p"
"Viewers, it's best to watch your COINS\n"
"like {STR_VAR_1} if you visit the GAME\l"
"CORNER and play the {STR_VAR_2} game.\p"
"This is live from the GAME CORNER--\n"
"where you can feel the excitement!\p"
"That's all for today!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1357
msgctxt "gTVFindThatGamerText02"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} played the {STR_VAR_2} game\n"
"and lost {STR_VAR_3} COINS.\p"
"“When {STR_VAR_1} comes, our COIN\n"
"sales seem to increase.”\p"
"That's what the GAME CORNER clerks\n"
"say when our gamer is in play!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1365
msgctxt "gTVFindThatGamerText03"
msgid ""
"Viewers, it's best to watch your COINS\n"
"like {STR_VAR_1} if you visit the GAME\l"
"CORNER and play the {STR_VAR_2} game.\p"
"This is live from the GAME CORNER--\n"
"where you can feel the excitement!\p"
"That's all for today!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1373
msgctxt "gTVBreakingNewsText00"
msgid "BREAKING NEWS TV!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1376
msgctxt "gTVBreakingNewsText01"
msgid ""
"Rare {STR_VAR_2} caught by\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"We're live from the vicinity of\n"
"{STR_VAR_3}!\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} successfully captured\n"
"a rare {STR_VAR_2} earlier here!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1384
msgctxt "gTVBreakingNewsText02"
msgid ""
"When {STR_VAR_1} encountered the rare\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}, the TRAINER sent out\l"
"the POKéMON {STR_VAR_3}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1389
msgctxt "gTVBreakingNewsText03"
msgid ""
"In the battle, the number of POKé\n"
"BALLS thrown by the TRAINER was {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Ultimately, the rare POKéMON was\n"
"caught by the {STR_VAR_2} used last.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1395
msgctxt "gTVBreakingNewsText04"
msgid ""
"In that instant, {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"echoed with {STR_VAR_1}'s roars of\l"
"triumphant joy.\p"
"I must say I'm a little envious of\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}. I'd love to roar, too.\p"
"…That ends the live feed from\n"
"the happy scene!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1404
msgctxt "gTVBreakingNewsText05"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} fails to capture a rare\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"We're live from the vicinity of\n"
"{STR_VAR_3}!\p"
"It was here that {STR_VAR_1} failed\n"
"to capture a rare {STR_VAR_2}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1412
msgctxt "gTVBreakingNewsText06"
msgid ""
"When {STR_VAR_1} encountered the rare\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}, the TRAINER sent out\l"
"the POKéMON {STR_VAR_3}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1417
msgctxt "gTVBreakingNewsText07"
msgid ""
"The TRAINER made the {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"use the move {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Without meaning to, the TRAINER\n"
"made the rare POKéMON faint…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1423
msgctxt "gTVBreakingNewsText12"
msgid ""
"However, {STR_VAR_1} panicked at\n"
"the sight of the rare {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"In confusion, the TRAINER ordered\n"
"{STR_VAR_3} to attack.\p"
"Without meaning to, the TRAINER\n"
"made the rare POKéMON faint.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1431
msgctxt "gTVBreakingNewsText08"
msgid ""
"In that instant, {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"echoed with {STR_VAR_1}'s shrieks of\l"
"frustration…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1436
msgctxt "gTVBreakingNewsText09"
msgid ""
"However, {STR_VAR_1} seemed to run\n"
"out of POKé BALLS.\p"
"The TRAINER had to break off\n"
"the battle with the rare {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"In that instant, {STR_VAR_3}\n"
"echoed with {STR_VAR_1}'s shrieks of\l"
"frustration…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1445
msgctxt "gTVBreakingNewsText10"
msgid ""
"However, the {STR_VAR_2} fled without\n"
"warning.\p"
"In that instant, {STR_VAR_3}\n"
"echoed with {STR_VAR_1}'s shrieks of\l"
"frustration…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1452
msgctxt "gTVBreakingNewsText11"
msgid ""
"I must say I feel for {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"Why, it makes me want to shriek, too.\p"
"…That ends the live feed from\n"
"the melancholy scene!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1458
msgctxt "gTVSecretBaseVisitText00"
msgid ""
"Hello, folks!\n"
"It's time again for\l"
"a SECRET BASE VISIT.\p"
"Today, we visit the SECRET BASE\n"
"of {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"How has {STR_VAR_1} personalized\n"
"the SECRET BASE?\p"
"Let's find out!\n"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1469
msgctxt "gTVSecretBaseVisitText01"
msgid ""
"Oh!\n"
"How marvelous!\p"
"This {STR_VAR_2}…\n"
"It's not what one would expect to\l"
"find here!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:1476
msgctxt "gTVSecretBaseVisitText02"
msgid ""
"Oh!\n"
