#: data/text/tv.inc:2001
msgctxt "gTVPokemonNewsBattleFrontierText18"
msgid ""
"Let's hope for more record-setting\n"
"feats from {STR_VAR_1} and the loyal\l"
"POKéMON!\p"
"That's the news on POKéMON NEWS!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2007
msgctxt "gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText00"
msgid ""
"WHAT'S NO. 1 IN HOENN TODAY?\n"
"Yes, it's that time again!\p"
"Hello, viewers! Are you giving your\n"
"best at whatever you do?\p"
"Let's have a look at the TRAINER\n"
"who did the very best today!\p"
"Today's no. 1 TRAINER is none other\n"
"than {STR_VAR_1}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2017
msgctxt "gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText01"
msgid ""
"In one day, {STR_VAR_1} spun the SLOTS\n"
"at the GAME CORNER {STR_VAR_2} times.\p"
"While playing, {STR_VAR_1} was heard\n"
"murmuring, “For me, the reels don't\l"
"even move…”\l"
"Isn't that interesting?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2025
msgctxt "gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText02"
msgid ""
"In one day, {STR_VAR_1} played\n"
"the ROULETTE game at the GAME\l"
"CORNER {STR_VAR_2} times.\p"
"While playing, {STR_VAR_1} shouted,\n"
"“Let the balls decide!”\p"
"The TRAINER's eyes were focused and\n"
"the face showed concentration.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2034
msgctxt "gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText03"
msgid ""
"In one day, {STR_VAR_1} battled\n"
"wild POKéMON {STR_VAR_2} times!\p"
"Apparently, {STR_VAR_1}'s POKéMON\n"
"have grown incomparably stronger.\p"
"They appear eager to battle anywhere,\n"
"anytime, and anyhow!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2042
msgctxt "gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText04"
msgid ""
"In just one day, {STR_VAR_1} spun\n"
"the BERRY BLENDER {STR_VAR_2} times!\p"
"Toward the end, even {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"seemed to get dizzy.\p"
"The TRAINER appeared to totter\n"
"around like a SPINDA!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2050
msgctxt "gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText05"
msgid ""
"In just one day, {STR_VAR_1} planted\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} BERRIES!\p"
"As a result, {STR_VAR_1}'s clothes\n"
"became filthy with dirt.\p"
"Where the TRAINER planted, countless\n"
"flowers have burst into bloom.\p"
"The flowers are said to soothe\n"
"the emotions of people.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2060
msgctxt "gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText06"
msgid ""
"In just one day, {STR_VAR_1} picked\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} BERRIES!\p"
"{STR_VAR_1}'s BAG became so filled\n"
"with BERRIES, the TRAINER had trouble\l"
"walking afterward!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2067
msgctxt "gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText07"
msgid ""
"In just one day, {STR_VAR_1} obtained\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} Battle Points!\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} was later seen wrestling\n"
"with the choice of exchanging\l"
"the Battle Points for a cool item or\l"
"a nifty interior decoration.\p"
"The TRAINER reportedly was grinning\n"
"while mulling options.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2077
msgctxt "gTVWhatsNo1InHoennTodayText08"
msgid ""
"Well, isn't that something!\p"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"You're today's no. 1 TRAINER!\p"
"Viewers, take heart from {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"You, too, can be no. 1 every day!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2084
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_Intro"
msgid ""
"SECRET BASE SECRETS!\p"
"What do TRAINERS do in the secrecy\n"
"of SECRET BASES?\p"
"Today, we investigate {STR_VAR_1}'s\n"
"SECRET BASE.\p"
"Oh? It looks like {STR_VAR_2} has come\n"
"for a visit.\p"
"Let's have a peek!\p"
"What will {STR_VAR_2} do?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2095
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_WhatWillPlayerDoNext1"
msgid "What will {STR_VAR_2} do next?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2098
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_WhatWillPlayerDoNext2"
msgid "And now, what will {STR_VAR_2} do?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2101
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_TookXStepsBeforeLeaving"
msgid ""
"In the end, {STR_VAR_2} took {STR_VAR_3} steps\n"
"in {STR_VAR_1}'s SECRET BASE before\l"
"leaving.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2106
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_BaseFailedToInterestPlayer"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\p"
"It appears as if {STR_VAR_1}'s SECRET\n"
"BASE failed to interest {STR_VAR_2}…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2111
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_PlayerEnjoyedBase"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2} appears to have enjoyed\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}'s SECRET BASE thoroughly.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2115
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_PlayerHugeFanOfBase"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2} appears to have become\n"
"a huge fan of {STR_VAR_1}'s\l"
"SECRET BASE.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2120
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_Outro"
msgid ""
"Viewers may want to check out\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}'s SECRET BASE, too.\p"
"Tune in next time as we visit another\n"
"SECRET BASE! Thanks for joining us!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2126
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_StoppedMoving1"
msgid ""
"The visitor has stopped!\p"
"The visitor isn't moving at all!\p"
"Was {STR_VAR_1}'s SECRET BASE\n"
"that unimpressive?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2132
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_StoppedMoving2"
msgid ""
"The visitor has stopped!\p"
"The visitor isn't moving at all!\p"
"Is it fatigue?\n"
"Has the visitor grown weary?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2138
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedChair"
msgid ""
"The visitor sat down on a chair!\n"
"The visitor is seated!\p"
"Look at that look of delight!\p"
"That chair must be very comfortable\n"
"to get that response!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2145
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedBalloon"
msgid ""
"The visitor charged at a balloon!\p"
"It burst!\n"
"Oh, my goodness, it popped!\p"
"The visitor appears startled by\n"
"the sudden noise!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2152
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedTent"
msgid ""
"The visitor entered a TENT!\p"
"The visitor is running around!\p"
"Oh, my, the visitor is frolicking!\p"
"The visitor appears surprised by\n"
"the TENT's size!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2159
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedPlant"
msgid ""
"The visitor is examining\n"
"a potted plant!\p"
"The visitor has surprisingly\n"
"mature taste!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2165
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedGoldShield"
msgid ""
"The visitor is examining\n"
"a GOLD SHIELD!\p"
"The visitor's eyes appear to be\n"
"lit up with wonder!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2171
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedSilverShield"
msgid ""
"The visitor is examining\n"
"a SILVER SHIELD!\p"
"The visitor appears to be wide-eyed!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2176
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedGlassOrnament"
msgid ""
"The visitor is examining\n"
"a GLASS ORNAMENT!\p"
"Oh, no!\p"
"The visitor is touching it!\p"
"It's getting covered with\n"
"fingerprints…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2184
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedTV"
msgid ""
"The visitor is watching television!\p"
"Looks like we have a big fan of TV!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2188
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedMudBall"
msgid ""
"The visitor stomped on a MUD BALL!\p"
"The visitor looks delighted!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2192
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedBag"
msgid ""
"…Oh?\p"
"The visitor is reaching for their own\n"
"BAG and rummaging about in it!\p"
"The visitor pulled out\n"
"one {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"Look at the visitor smile while\n"
"holding up the {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"It's like a TV commercial!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2202
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedCushion"
msgid "The visitor grabs a cushion and…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2205
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_HitCushion"
msgid ""
"…begins hitting it!\p"
"Is the visitor under a lot of stress?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2209
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_HuggedCushion"
msgid ""
"…hugs it tight!\p"
"Could the visitor be feeling happy\n"
"about something?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2214
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_BattledWon"
msgid ""
"The visitor is chatting with\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"It looks like they're going to\n"
"have a battle!\p"
"And…\p"
"It's the visitor!\n"
"The visitor won an away match!\p"
"The visitor is doing\n"
"a victory dance!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2225
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_BattledLost"
msgid ""
"The visitor is chatting with\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"It looks like they're going to\n"
"have a battle!\p"
"And…\p"
"It's {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"The visitor has lost!\p"
"The visitor looks dejected!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2235
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_DeclinedBattle"
msgid ""
"The visitor is chatting with\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"It looks like they're going to\n"
"have a battle!\p"
"And…\p"
"No, the visitor has refused!\p"
"There won't be a battle after all!\p"
"Did the visitor find {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"unappealing?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2246
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedPoster"
msgid ""
"The visitor is staring intently\n"
"at a poster!\p"
"Is the poster to the visitor's\n"
"liking?\p"
"…But… There's something disturbing\n"
"about the visitor's stares.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2254
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedNoteMat"
msgid ""
"The visitor stepped on a NOTE MAT!\p"
"…Hmm…\n"
"The visitor composed a funny tune!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2259
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_BattledDraw"
msgid ""
"The visitor is chatting with\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"It looks like they're going to\n"
"have a battle!\p"
"And…\p"
"It's a draw!\n"
"Nothing's resolved!\p"
"Both TRAINERS appear to be very\n"
"disappointed!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2270
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedSpinMat"
msgid ""
"The visitor stepped on\n"
"a SPIN MAT!\p"
"It looks like the visitor is dizzy!\p"
"The visitor is tottering about!\n"
"Look out!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2277
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedSandOrnament"
msgid ""
"The visitor is reaching for\n"
"a SAND ORNAMENT!\p"
"Oh!\p"
"It crumbled!\n"
"It's fallen apart!\p"
"The visitor looks sheepish\n"
"and guilty!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2286
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedDesk"
msgid ""
"The visitor is rubbing a desktop\n"
"with their finger!\p"
"Apparently, the visitor disapproves\n"
"of dust!\p"
"The visitor is surprisingly concerned\n"
"about neatness!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2294
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedBrick"
msgid ""
"The visitor is staring at a BRICK!\p"
"Perhaps the visitor is thinking about\n"
"the object on the BRICK.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2299
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedSolidBoard"
msgid ""
"The visitor is walking across\n"
"the SOLID BOARD.\p"
"The visitor keeps looking down.\p"
"The visitor appears to be surprisingly\n"
"timid and cautious!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2306
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedFence"
msgid ""
"The visitor is looking intently\n"
"at a FENCE!\p"
"Has a new idea for a trap popped\n"
"into the visitor's head?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2312
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedGlitterMat"
msgid ""
"The visitor stepped on\n"
"a GLITTER MAT!\p"
"The visitor is striking a variety\n"
"of poses!\p"
"The visitor appears to be fantasizing\n"
"about being an idol!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2320
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedTire"
msgid ""
"The visitor is staring intently\n"
"at a TIRE!\p"
"Could the visitor be thinking about\n"
"the kind of car that would use it?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2326
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedStand"
msgid ""
"The visitor climbed a STAND!\p"
"The visitor is looking out across\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}'s BASE from high up!\p"
"And…\p"
"Lets loose a roar!\n"
"The visitor is roaring!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2334
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_BrokeDoor"
msgid ""
"The visitor charged headlong into\n"
"a BREAKABLE DOOR!\p"
"The visitor is laughing uproariously!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2339
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedDoll"
msgid ""
"The visitor is talking to a DOLL!\p"
"…It's a little creepy…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2343
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedSlide"
msgid ""
"The visitor is climbing the ladder\n"
"on a SLIDE!\p"
"And…\p"
"The visitor slid down!\p"
"Looks like the visitor is having\n"
"a grand old time!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2351
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedSlideButDidntGoDown"
msgid ""
"The visitor is climbing the ladder\n"
"on a SLIDE!\p"
"And…\p"
"The visitor went back down\n"
"the ladder!\p"
"Did the visitor suddenly chicken out?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2359
msgctxt "TVSecretBaseSecrets_Text_UsedJumpMat"
msgid ""
"The visitor stepped on\n"
"a JUMP MAT!\p"
"The visitor jumped once!\p"
"Jumped twice!\p"
"And a successful landing!\p"
"The visitor is clapping!\n"
"What a solo performance!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2368
msgctxt "gTVSafariFanClubText00"
msgid ""
"SAFARI FAN CLUB!\p"
"REPORTER: All right, mates!\n"
"Tossing them SAFARI BALLS, are you?\p"
"You can bet I am here in the SAFARI\n"
"ZONE chock-full of amazing POKéMON!\p"
"Let's get with it and have a chat with\n"
"this good fellow of a SAFARI GUIDE!\p"
"All right, mate, how are the visiting\n"
"TRAINERS looking?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2379
msgctxt "gTVSafariFanClubText01"
msgid ""
"GUIDE: Everyone seems to be going\n"
"hard at it.\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} is doing especially well.\p"
"Why, before, {STR_VAR_1} caught\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2386
msgctxt "gTVSafariFanClubText02"
msgid ""
"The TRAINER is clever with {POKEBLOCK}S.\n"
"Used {STR_VAR_2} that time, I think.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2390
msgctxt "gTVSafariFanClubText03"
msgid ""
"The TRAINER didn't use a single\n"
"{POKEBLOCK}! Not a one!\p"
"There's an expert for you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2395
msgctxt "gTVSafariFanClubText04"
msgid ""
"REPORTER: Is that right, then?\p"
"Sounds like our mate {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"is a stout SAFARI master!\p"
"GUIDE: I hope the TRAINER comes back\n"
"and shows us that great technique.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2402
msgctxt "gTVSafariFanClubText05"
msgid ""
"GUIDE: No one seems to be doing\n"
"very well.\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} had it especially bad.\p"
"Why, before, the TRAINER only\n"
"managed to catch {STR_VAR_2} POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2409
msgctxt "gTVSafariFanClubText06"
msgid ""
"GUIDE: No one seems to be doing\n"
"very well.\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} had it especially bad.\p"
"Why, before, the TRAINER didn't\n"
"catch one POKéMON. Not a one!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2416
msgctxt "gTVSafariFanClubText07"
msgid ""
"The TRAINER does use {POKEBLOCK}S.\n"
"Used {STR_VAR_2} that time, I think.\p"
"But, boy, I wish the TRAINER would\n"
"get a bit better at this.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2422
msgctxt "gTVSafariFanClubText08"
msgid ""
"I think the TRAINER would have better\n"
"luck using {POKEBLOCK}S, which weren't\l"
"used at all that time.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2427
msgctxt "gTVSafariFanClubText09"
msgid ""
"REPORTER: Is that right, then?\p"
"Sounds like our mate {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"needs more SAFARI seasoning.\p"
"GUIDE: I hope the TRAINER visits\n"
"over and over to get the hang of it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2434
msgctxt "gTVSafariFanClubText10"
msgid ""
"REPORTER: Quite right, it is!\n"
"Facing up to challenges is important!\p"
"Viewers, come on down to the SAFARI\n"
"and make the challenge yourself!\p"
"Until next time, cheerio!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2441
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_Intro"
msgid ""
"“POKéMON CONTEST LIVE UPDATES!”\p"
"MC: Thanks for joining us!\p"
"We're live from the just-ended\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} site.\p"
"The hall is still filled with\n"
"an audience unwilling to leave.\p"
"Spectator: {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"Spectator: {STR_VAR_3}!\p"
"MC: As you've just heard, the CONTEST\n"
"was won by the POKéMON {STR_VAR_2}\l"
"of {STR_VAR_3}.\p"
"Spectator: {STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"You're the best!\p"
"Spectator: {STR_VAR_3}!\n"
"Way to go!\p"
"MC: Let's hear what the fans have\n"
"to say about this CONTEST.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2460
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_WonBothRounds"
msgid ""
"Spectator: The {STR_VAR_2} was tops in\n"
"both primary and secondary judging!\p"
"That {STR_VAR_2} will keep winning!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2465
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_BetterRound2"
msgid ""
"Spectator: The {STR_VAR_2} didn't do\n"
"well in the primary judging, but it\l"
"cleaned up in the secondary judging!\p"
"It was a miraculous comeback\n"
"for that {STR_VAR_2}. Yippee!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2472
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_EqualRounds"
msgid ""
"Spectator: The {STR_VAR_2} remained\n"
"consistent throughout both primary\l"
"and secondary judging.\p"
"{STR_VAR_3} and the {STR_VAR_2},\n"
"they're no ordinary combo!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2479
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_BetterRound1"
msgid ""
"Spectator: In terms of being {STR_VAR_1},\n"
"that {STR_VAR_2} was outstanding.\p"
"I hope it makes better appeals\n"
"next time, though.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2485
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_GotNervous"
msgid ""
"Spectator: When the {STR_VAR_2} got\n"
"nervous, I couldn't stop myself from\l"
"shouting encouragement.\p"
"I'd like to say this to that\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}, “Congratulations!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2492
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_StartledFoes"
msgid ""
"Spectator: That {STR_VAR_2}'s appeal\n"
"startled even me!\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}, you were awesome!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2497
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_UsedCombo"
msgid ""
"Spectator: That {STR_VAR_2}'s combo\n"
"appeal was stunning!\p"
"It's shaken me to the core!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2502
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_ExcitingAppeal"
msgid ""
"Spectator: The winning {STR_VAR_2}'s\n"
"appeal got my heart pounding!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2506
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_WasCool"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"You were cool!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2510
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_WasBeautiful"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"You were beautiful!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2514
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_WasCute"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"You were cute!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2518
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_WasSmart"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"You were smart!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2522
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_WasTough"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"You were tough!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2526
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_VeryExcitingAppeal"
msgid ""
"Spectator: The winning {STR_VAR_2}'s\n"
"appeal still has my heart pounding!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2530
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_VeryCool"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"You're the last word in cool!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2534
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_VeryBeautiful"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"You're the most beautiful!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2538
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_VeryCute"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"You're simply the cutest!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2542
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_VerySmart"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"You're the smartest among the smart!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2546
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_VeryTough"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"You're the toughest of the tough!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2550
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_TookBreak"
msgid ""
"Spectator: Even when the {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"took a break from making appeals,\l"
"I couldn't take my eyes off it.\p"
"I'm captivated by that {STR_VAR_2}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2556
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_GotStartled"
msgid ""
"Spectator: When the {STR_VAR_2} was\n"
"startled by another POKéMON's appeal,\l"
"I was close to tears.\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}, you were resilient!\n"
"Way to go!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2563
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_MoveWonderful"
msgid ""
"Spectator: Oh…\n"
"That {STR_VAR_2}'s {STR_VAR_3}!\l"
"{STR_VAR_2}'s {STR_VAR_3}!\l"
"{STR_VAR_2}'s {STR_VAR_3}!\l"
"How could it be so wonderful?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2570
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_TalkAboutAnotherMon"
msgid ""
"MC: Well, there you have it. This place\n"
"is full of the {STR_VAR_1}'s fans!\p"
"I should also mention that another\n"
"POKéMON, {STR_VAR_2}'s {STR_VAR_3}, \l"
"caught my eye.\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}'s {STR_VAR_3}…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2578
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_FailedToAppeal"
msgid ""
"It failed to make a single appeal during\n"
"secondary judging out of nervousness.\p"
"Next time, I would like to see this\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} make even one appeal.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2584
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_LastInBothRounds"
msgid ""
"It came dead last in both primary\n"
"and secondary judging.\p"
"I hope that {STR_VAR_1} will retrain this\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} and erase the shame of\l"
"this undisputed last-place finish.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2591
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_NotExcitingEnough"
msgid ""
"It failed to take advantage of\n"
"the audience's excitement and make\l"
"an appropriate appeal.\p"
"We hope {STR_VAR_1} will learn how to get\n"
"a feel for the audience and whip their\l"
"excitement to a fever pitch next time.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2599
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_LostAfterWinningRound1"
msgid ""
"While finishing first in the primary\n"
"judging, its appeals in the secondary\l"
"judging failed to click.\p"
"It suffered a humiliating come-from-\n"
"behind loss.\p"
"I'm sure {STR_VAR_1} is studying how to\n"
"make more effective appeals now.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2608
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_NeverExciting"
msgid ""
"The audience never got excited by its\n"
"appeals during the secondary judging.\p"
"We hope it will stop worrying about\n"
"other POKéMON and learn to pitch\l"
"its appeals to the audience more.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2615
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_LostBySmallMargin"
msgid ""
"It lost to {STR_VAR_1}'s {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"by only a small margin.\p"
"It must be heartbreaking to come\n"
"so close to victory only to fail.\p"
"I wouldn't be surprised if {STR_VAR_3}\n"
"were weeping over this outcome.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2623
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_RepeatedAppeals"
msgid ""
"It disappointed the JUDGE by\n"
"repeating the same appeals.\p"
"It's an unforgivable error in any\n"
"CONTEST, and the POKéMON paid.\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} should feel guilty for\n"
"this sorry showing.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2631
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_ValiantEffortButLost"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} turned in a valiant effort,\n"
"but…\p"
"It was all for naught, finishing last.\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} should learn from this loss\n"
"and put the knowledge to good use.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2638
msgctxt "ContestLiveUpdates_Text_Outro"
msgid ""
"I'd like to end this program with our\n"
"usual farewell to the winners.\p"
"This time, it's {STR_VAR_1} and\n"
"the {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"MC: Is everyone ready?\n"
"All together now!\p"
"Audience: {STR_VAR_1}! {STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"Congratulations!\l"
"You're the CONTEST winner!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2649
msgctxt "gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText00"
msgid ""
"“POKéMON BATTLE UPDATE!”\p"
"Bringing you the results of POKéMON\n"
"battles as they come in!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2654
msgctxt "gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText01"
msgid ""
"The TRAINERS {STR_VAR_1} and\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} faced each other in\l"
"a {STR_VAR_3} BATTLE.\p"
"This match ended in victory for\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2661
msgctxt "gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText02"
msgid ""
"In the battle, {STR_VAR_1}'s\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} was a formidable force\l"
"using {STR_VAR_3}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2666
msgctxt "gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText03"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}'s {STR_VAR_2} had a weak\n"
"showing that really hurt.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2670
msgctxt "gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText04"
msgid ""
"Congratulations on your victory,\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"And for the defeated {STR_VAR_2},\n"
"we hope for a better result next time!\p"
"This concludes this episode of\n"
"“POKéMON BATTLE UPDATE!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2678
msgctxt "gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText05"
msgid ""
"The teams of TRAINERS {STR_VAR_1} and\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} met in a MULTI BATTLE.\p"
"This match ended in victory for\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}'s team.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2684
msgctxt "gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText06"
msgid ""
"In the battle, the {STR_VAR_2} on\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}'s team was a formidable\l"
"force using {STR_VAR_3}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2689
msgctxt "gTVPokemonBattleUpdateText07"
msgid ""
"The weak showing by the {STR_VAR_3}\n"
"on {STR_VAR_2}'s team really hurt.\p"
"Congratulations on your team's\n"
"victory, {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"As for the defeated {STR_VAR_2}'s team,\n"
"we hope for a better result next time!\p"
"This concludes this episode of\n"
"“POKéMON BATTLE UPDATE!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2699
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_GabbyPreFirstBattle"
msgid ""
"GABBY: Oh! We've just spotted a tough-\n"
"looking TRAINER here of all places!\p"
"Okay, roll camera!\n"
"Let's get this interview.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2705
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_GabbyIntro"
msgid ""
"GABBY: Oh! You're {PLAYER}! Hi!\n"
"Do you remember us from last time?\p"
"Can you show us how much stronger\n"
"you've become? Okay, cue interview!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2711
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_GabbyDefeatFirstTime"
msgid ""
"GABBY: My eyes didn't lie!\n"
"I did discover an astonishing TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2715
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_WhoAreYouInterview"
msgid ""
"GABBY: Awesome! Awesome!\n"
"Who are you?!\p"
"I knew we were onto something wild\n"
"when we spotted you!\p"
"Oh, please let me explain. We travel\n"
"around everywhere interviewing all\l"
"sorts of TRAINERS.\p"
"So, would you give us a bit of your time\n"
"for an interview?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2726
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_QuoteFromLastInterview"
msgid ""
"GABBY: “{STR_VAR_1}!”\p"
"Remember? That's the quote you gave\n"
"us as the battle clincher last time.\p"
"I never, ever forget stuff like that!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2732
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_YouStompedUsInterviewAgain"
msgid ""
"The last time we battled, you stomped\n"
"us before we could brace ourselves…\p"
"Anyway, what do you think?\n"
"Do you want to be interviewed again?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2738
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_YouThrewABallAtUsInterviewAgain"
msgid ""
"The last time we battled, didn't you\n"
"throw a POKé BALL at us?\p"
"We were shocked! So we told everyone,\n"
"just everyone, about it!\p"
"Anyway, what do you think?\n"
"Do you want to be interviewed again?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2746
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_CleverItemSkillsInterviewAgain"
msgid ""
"The last time we battled, your item\n"
"skills cleverly did us in.\p"
"Anyway, what do you think?\n"
"Do you want to be interviewed again?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2752
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_WeLookedRespectableInterviewAgain"
msgid ""
"The last time we battled, we managed\n"
"to look respectable.\p"
"Anyway, what do you think?\n"
"Do you want to be interviewed again?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2758
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_InterviewAgain"
msgid ""
"Anyway, what do you think?\n"
"Do you want to be interviewed again?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2762
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_DescribeYourFeelings"
msgid ""
"You will?\n"
"Thank you!\p"
"Okay, I need you to describe your\n"
"feelings about our battle, but it\l"
"has to be short and sweet. Go!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2769
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_PerfectWellBeSeeingYou"
msgid ""
"GABBY: Mmm, yeah!\n"
"That's the perfect clincher!\p"
"I get the feeling that this will make\n"
"a great TV show.\p"
"There's a chance that they'll air this\n"
"on TV, so make sure to look for us!\p"
"Okay!\n"
"We'll be seeing you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2779
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_DontGiveUpKeepingEyeOut"
msgid ""
"GABBY: Oh…\p"
"Okay, but don't give up!\n"
"We'll be keeping an eye out for you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2784
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_KeepingAnEyeOutForYou"
msgid ""
"GABBY: We'll be keeping an eye out\n"
"for you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2788
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_GabbyNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"GABBY: Is there a strong TRAINER\n"
"anywhere with a lot of POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2792
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_GiveUsAnInterviewThisTime"
msgid ""
"GABBY: Wow, you are something!\p"
"You've gotten a lot stronger--a lot--\n"
"since we last battled.\p"
"We were right about you when we\n"
"spotted you as a hot TRAINER.\p"
"So, anyway, what do you think?\n"
"Are you willing to give us an interview\l"
"this time?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2802
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_GabbyDefeat"
msgid ""
"GABBY: That was an intense battle!\n"
"Did you get all that on camera?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2806
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_TyPreFirstBattle"
msgid ""
"TY: Hey, lookie here! A tough-looking\n"
"TRAINER here, of all places!\l"
"Camera's rolling!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2811
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_TyIntro"
msgid ""
"TY: Hey, lookie here!\n"
"I remember you!\p"
"I'll get this battle all on this\n"
"here camera!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2817
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_TyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"TY: You're a natural!\n"
"Got me some prime footage right here!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2821
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_TyNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"TY: Do you only have the one POKéMON\n"
"and that's it?\p"
"If you had more POKéMON, it'd make for\n"
"better footage, but…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2827
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_TyDefeatFirstTime"
msgid ""
"TY: Yep, we sure spotted a hot TRAINER.\n"
"This is a huge scoop for us!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2831
msgctxt "GabbyAndTy_Text_TyDefeat"
msgid ""
"TY: Yep, I got it all.\n"
"That whole battle's on camera.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2835
msgctxt "gTVInSearchOfTrainersText00"
msgid ""
"IN SEARCH OF TRAINERS…\p"
"GABBY: Hi! Today I'm visiting an area\n"
"near {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"We're trying to spot some up-and-\n"
"coming new talent in the field.\p"
"Today, we turned our lens on the\n"
"TRAINER {PLAYER}.\p"
"There's something about this TRAINER\n"
"that piqued our interest.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2846
msgctxt "gTVInSearchOfTrainersText01"
msgid ""
"We've battled {PLAYER} before, but we\n"
"can attest that the TRAINER has most\l"
"definitely improved from before.\p"
"I knew we were onto someone special\n"
"when we spotted this TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2853
msgctxt "gTVInSearchOfTrainersText02"
msgid ""
"The best way to determine how strong\n"
"a TRAINER is…\p"
"Well, the fastest way is to battle.\n"
"And so we began our investigation!\p"
"… …\p"
"That's how we ended up in battle\n"
"with {PLAYER}.\p"
"In a dominating performance, we were\n"
"flattened, rolled up, and tossed aside!\p"
"{PLAYER} is ruthlessly strong…\p"
"Here's our impressions after having\n"
"battled our featured TRAINER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2867
msgctxt "gTVInSearchOfTrainersText03"
msgid ""
"The combination of {STR_VAR_1} and\n"
"{STR_VAR_3} was divine!\p"
"The sight of them--{STR_VAR_1} and\n"
"{STR_VAR_3}--selflessly supporting\l"
"each other in the thick of battle…\p"
"It was a marvelous sight to behold!\p"
"{STR_VAR_2} was the move the TRAINER\n"
"used last in our battle.\p"
"The move {STR_VAR_2} is {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"and {STR_VAR_3}'s sign of friendship!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2879
msgctxt "gTVInSearchOfTrainersText04"
msgid ""
"…I lost confidence in myself as\n"
"a result of our encounter.\p"
"We were beaten before we could launch\n"
"a single attack.\l"
"Ohhh… Snivel…\p"
"In spite of that, {PLAYER}'s battles\n"
"are worth seeing.\p"
"I recommend confident TRAINERS to\n"
"challenge {PLAYER}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2890
msgctxt "gTVInSearchOfTrainersText05"
msgid ""
"There's only one thing to be said.\n"
"Don't you dare throw a POKé BALL during\l"
"a TRAINER battle!\p"
"{PLAYER} is certainly strong, but has\n"
"no clue about the basic rules.\p"
"To our TV audience, I have a request.\p"
"If you see {PLAYER}, please caution\n"
"the TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2900
msgctxt "gTVInSearchOfTrainersText06"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} is adept at reading the\n"
"opponent's actions.\p"
"The timing of item usage was remarkably\n"
"effective!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2906
msgctxt "gTVInSearchOfTrainersText07"
msgid ""
"Honestly speaking, I thought that\n"
"I might even be pretty good.\p"
"While we did end up losing, we did have\n"
"a hotly contested battle.\p"
"But if you're struggling against me,\n"
"you have a ways to go, {PLAYER}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2914
msgctxt "gTVInSearchOfTrainersText08"
msgid ""
"After our battle, we asked {PLAYER} for\n"
"a succinct summary.\p"
"The TRAINER replied, “{STR_VAR_1}.”\p"
"{PLAYER}'s POKéMON {STR_VAR_2} and\n"
"{STR_VAR_3}…\l"
"And “{STR_VAR_1}”…\p"
"Mmm! That's deep! There's deep\n"
"significance behind that quote!\p"
"It's no surprise--a good TRAINER has\n"
"good things to say.\p"
"That's all for today!\n"
"See you again on our next broadcast!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2928
msgctxt "ContestLadyShow_Text_Intro"
msgid ""
"“POKéMON CONTEST LIVE UPDATES!”\p"
"MC: Sorry to interrupt the regular\n"
"programming, and thanks for joining us!\p"
"We bring you this live from\n"
"the scene of a just-completed\l"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"Spectators: ?!!!!\p"
"MC: Oh! It looks like the CONTEST\n"
"participants are headed this way!\p"
"I'll try to get an impromptu interview\n"
"for you folks at home!\p"
"Spectators: ?!!!!\n"
"?!!!!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2943
msgctxt "ContestLadyShow_Text_Won"
msgid ""
"MC: Excuse me!\n"
"Thanks for joining us on live TV!\p"
"May I congratulate you on your win?\p"
"What was the key factor in today's\n"
"stunning victory?\p"
"BEAUTY: We gave it our best effort\n"
"today, my {STR_VAR_2} and I!\p"
"But I'm sure we wouldn't have made it\n"
"if it weren't for all the help we\l"
"received leading up to the CONTEST!\p"
"MC: Do you have a special someone\n"
"with whom you'd like to share your joy?\l"
"Let's hear it live!\p"
"BEAUTY: Hey, out there!\p"
"{STR_VAR_3}! Are you watching?\n"
"We did it!\l"
"Thank you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2962
msgctxt "ContestLadyShow_Text_Lost"
msgid ""
"MC: Excuse me!\n"
"Thanks for joining us on live TV!\p"
"You must be disappointed by that turn\n"
"of events. Do you have any comments?\p"
"BEAUTY: It's heartbreaking…\n"
"My {STR_VAR_2} and I, we did our best…\p"
"But I feel like I've let down everyone\n"
"who has supported us through this.\p"
"MC: I hate to say it, but the POKéMON's\n"
"coloration is a little wanting.\p"
"BEAUTY: {STR_VAR_3}, I'm so sorry…\n"
"I'll do better next time, I swear…\l"
"…Sniff… Waaaaah!\p"
"Spectators: See that?\n"
"The poor girl!\p"
"MC: Uh… Uh-oh…\p"
"Uh… That's all the time we have today!\n"
"Thanks for tuning in!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/tv.inc:2982
msgctxt "ContestLadyShow_Text_LostBadly"
msgid ""
"MC: Excuse me!\n"
"Thanks for joining us on live TV!\p"
"How did your CONTEST appearance go?\p"
"BEAUTY: Nothing went right…\n"
"For some reason, my {STR_VAR_2}\l"
"couldn't attract any popularity.\p"
"MC: I hate to say it, but the POKéMON's\n"
"coloration is a little wanting.\p"
"BEAUTY: … … … … … …\n"
"…Sniff… Waaaaah!\p"
"Spectators: See that?\n"
"The poor girl!\p"
"MC: Uh… Uh-oh…\p"
"Uh… That's all the time we have today!\n"
"Thanks for tuning in!$"
msgstr ""
